asr-000104
00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:50.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: The breakdown of the budget, and we have made a general breakdown here in this slide,

asr-000105
00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:58.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: shows that the budget is divided into several components.

asr-000106
00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:06.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: First of all, the budget covers the organizational outcome one,

asr-000107
00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:13.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: which is really the repair, maintenance, and the building of national roads and bridges,

asr-000108
00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:15.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: or the National Roads and Bridges Program.

asr-000109
00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:18.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Roughly 200 billion.

asr-000110
00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:31.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: The Foreign Assisted Projects Program, these are covered by the various official development assistance loans,

asr-000111
00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:38.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and comprise of the big ticket flagship projects, not only of the PWH, but of the entire government.

asr-000112
00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:44.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Roughly about 118 billion.

asr-000113
00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:54.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: The, and for this year, as we all know po, nung 2026,

asr-000114
00:06:56.960 --> 00:07:05.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dinesisyonan po ng both executive at ng kongreso na wala munang flood mitigation program na locally funded.

asr-000115
00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:07.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya, pero po ngayong 2027,

asr-000116
00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:18.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 2027 meron na po, at ang locally funded projects po natin for 2027 ay 83.84 billion.

asr-000117
00:07:18.760 --> 00:07:25.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero meron din po tayong Foreign Assisted Ongoing Flood Mitigation Projects.

asr-000118
00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:33.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasama po ito dun sa 117 billion Foreign Assisted Projects worth 19 billion.

asr-000119
00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:38.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron din po tayong Basic Infrastructure Program.

asr-000120
00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:48.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Divided into 105 billion for access roads and bridges.

asr-000121
00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:54.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: From the national roads leading to major strategic facilities.

asr-000122
00:07:54.500 --> 00:08:02.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron po tayong 40.97 billion multipurpose buildings to support social services.

asr-000123
00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:10.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron din po tayong coastal roads to augment resiliency na 1.38 billion.

asr-000124
00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:15.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And meron din po tayong 419 million for local ports.

asr-000125
00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:20.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: These four components form part of the Basic Infrastructure Program.

asr-000126
00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:32.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron din po 510 million na construction and rehabilitation for PWDs and elderlies as mandated by law.

asr-000127
00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:37.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron din po tayong 1 billion rehabilitation of disaster infrastructure.

asr-000128
00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:40.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ito po yung ating commonly termed as yung,

asr-000129
00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:43.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Quick Response Fund natin during calamities.

asr-000130
00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:58.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And meron din pong 7.29 billion na construction and rehabilitation of water supply as mandated by the 1989 Republic Act on Water Supply.

asr-000131
00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:01.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yung batas po natin on water supply.

asr-000132
00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:10.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Apart from this po, meron din po tayo yung ating automatic appropriations which essentially cover,

asr-000133
00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:18.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: personal services, maintenance and other operating expenses.

asr-000134
00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:22.400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And meron din po tayong support to operations.

asr-000135
00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:26.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ito po yung mga feasibility studies natin, mga detailed engineering natin,

asr-000136
00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:31.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: mga ating mga studies to make plans and programs.

asr-000137
00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:35.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Right of way worth 27.3 billion.

asr-000138
00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:40.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And finally yung general administration and support po na 2.77 billion.

asr-000139
00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:43.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: The details of which we can provide the committee as well.

asr-000140
00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:50.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And which has already provided in the current draft of the, in the National Expenditure Program.

asr-000141
00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:54.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So this gives us a bird's eye view po.

asr-000142
00:09:54.800 --> 00:10:02.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Now if kumamagapatin niyo po, I will now proceed with the budget reforms that we have initiated over the course of the past 11 months.

asr-000143
00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:08.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unang-una po, mag-start po tayo sa basics.

asr-000144
00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:14.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Uunahin ko na po na skin-wrap na po natin yung formula na,

asr-000145
00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:20.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung tinatawag nilang parametric formula na ginagamit nung nakaraang mga ilang taon.

asr-000146
00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:27.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We simplified the allocations to be based on three core components.

asr-000147
00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:31.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: First of all po, ang utos po ng ating Pangulo,

asr-000148
00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:35.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: i-prioritize yung mga nakatenga o hindi tapos.

asr-000149
00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:41.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So we are prioritizing, trying to complete in some cases within the next fiscal year,

asr-000150
00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:44.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: in most cases, dahil po maglalaki pa ang requirements,

asr-000151
00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:51.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: in succeeding years, yung mga nakatenga o unfinished nating mga proyekto.

asr-000152
00:10:51.420 --> 00:11:02.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ikalawa po, importante din po sa Pangulo, ay yung mandato ng DPWH na i-prioritize ang maintenance and repair of critical infrastructure.

asr-000153
00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:06.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ito yung ating mga national roads and national bridges.

asr-000154
00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:13.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At kasama na rin po yung mga flood mitigation infrastructures na nasisira.

asr-000155
00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:17.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nakita naman natin nitong mga nakaraang mga dumaan na bagyo.

asr-000156
00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:20.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kailangan din po i-repair po yan ng mabilisan.

asr-000157
00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:28.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And i-address din po yung immediate needs ng mga communities,

asr-000158
00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:35.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: which are covered mostly by the basic infrastructure program o yung BIT program natin.

asr-000159
00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:42.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Base po dito, nag-implement po tayo ng very, very strict evaluation

asr-000160
00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:46.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: project evaluation system.

asr-000161
00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:52.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unang-una po, pinagakas po natin ang technical and project vetting.

asr-000162
00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:57.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Makikita po natin ito sa mga susunod na slide kung ano po ang ginawa natin

asr-000163
00:11:57.060 --> 00:12:02.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: para masigurado na ang mga project ay talagang na-vet ng maayos.

asr-000164
00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:06.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yung pagsisigurado po, alimbawa, na mayroong mga plano, lahat ng mga project,

asr-000165
00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:13.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: hindi po tulad ng dati na madalas ang nangyayari, project title lang po at cost ang pumapasok

asr-000166
00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:13.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa NEP.

asr-000167
00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:16.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Wala po yung marami po dyan.

asr-000168
00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:22.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Wala pong mga plano, wala pong mga FS, hindi po basis sa mga existing master plans natin.

asr-000169
00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:29.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ikarawa po, we are improving project information and traceability.

asr-000170
00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:35.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I-upload po namin, hindi lang po yung mga project titles na nandito sa NEP,

asr-000171
00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:42.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kundi i-upload din po namin lahat po ng supporting documents ng lahat ng mga project

asr-000172
00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:48.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na nakapaloob sa NEP para po makita lang, hindi lamang ng ating honorable committee,

asr-000173
00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pero makita din po ng buong publiko.

asr-000174
00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:58.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ikatro po, very, very strict po tayo ngayon sa mga mandatory documentary requirements

asr-000175
00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:01.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: which I will expound on in the coming slides.

asr-000176
00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:05.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sinisigurado na po natin ngayon, kagaya nung nasabi ko kanina,

asr-000177
00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:12.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na hindi lang project title at cost ang nakapaloob sa National Expenditure Program.

asr-000178
00:13:12.860 --> 00:13:18.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nandito na rin po ang lahat ng supporting mandatory requirements ng bawat proyekto.

asr-000179
00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:26.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ito po, next slide, ito po ang stringent project requirements po natin ngayon.

asr-000180
00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:31.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Lahat po ng proyekto na nakapaloob dito sa National Expenditure Program natin

asr-000181
00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:36.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ay dapat merong approved program of work.

asr-000182
00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:43.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ito po yung kabilin-bilina ng ating Pangulo, dahil nga po siya mismo nakita niya for himself,

asr-000183
00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:48.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na kapag po nung nag-expect siya po siya ng mga iba't ibang proyekto,

asr-000184
00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:53.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: madalas po pag humihingi siya ng plano, wala pong ma-produce na plano ang DPWH.

asr-000185
00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:56.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ito po ay nasa level na ng implementation.

asr-000186
00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ito po, rinirequire na po natin ang plano,

asr-000187
00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:08.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ngayong parang po na ipapaloob pa natin lang sa budget ang mga proyektong nakapaloob sa National Expenditure Program.

asr-000188
00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:13.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ikaliwa po, yung validated geo-tagged photos.

asr-000189
00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:21.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I will, if you will allow me to explain ano ang pagkakaiba po nung ginawa namin ngayon dun sa ginawa dati.

asr-000190
00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:27.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dati po, and I think we have all seen this in the height of the flood control scandal,

asr-000191
00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:35.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: madalas po sa mga geo-tagging na nangyari o mga coordinates na nangyari,

asr-000192
00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:43.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pagdating po sa pre-planning, sa planning stage, meaning sa pagpasok po ng mga proyekto sa budget,

asr-000193
00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:54.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: either wala pong coordinates or kung meron man, ito po ay tinatawag nating tabletop coordinates lang.

asr-000194
00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:59.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meaning, ginugel map, tapos inupload po.

asr-000195
00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:04.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At marami pa po sa mga proyekto, wala. Ni ito, wala. Noong itong nakaraan.

asr-000196
00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:14.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ngayon po, dito sa mga proyektong pinasok natin sa National Expenditure Program, required po ang geotag photos on-site.

asr-000197
00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:19.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meaning po, alam naman po natin, sanay naman po tayo sa mga apps natin sa telepono,

asr-000198
00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:27.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: required po silang mag-upload on-site ng geotag photos na nandun mismo ang picture ng lugar,

asr-000199
00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:31.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kasama yung coordinates na geotag mismo.

asr-000200
00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:40.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, hindi na po pwede yung nasa opisina lang po sila at google map sila at igagagay nila kung saan saan na lang.

asr-000201
00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:41.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi na po pwede yun.

asr-000202
00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:48.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: The project engineers, the district engineers, the planning engineers need to go on-site

asr-000203
00:15:48.140 --> 00:15:56.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and photograph the site with the coordinates attached automatically to the photos.

asr-000204
00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:57.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Required po yan.

asr-000205
00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:02.400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ikatlo po, requirement po ito ng Department of Budget Management,

asr-000206
00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:10.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung required BP-202 compliance forms na nakapaloob po dyan lahat ng information tungkol sa proyekto.

asr-000207
00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:16.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ikaapat po, and I will again discuss this in depth in one slide,

asr-000208
00:16:16.340 --> 00:16:24.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: required pong pumirma lahat ng heads of implementation offices, district engineers and regional directors

asr-000209
00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:27.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ng tinatawag na Certificate of Implementation.

asr-000210
00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:30.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ano po itong Certificate of Implementability?

asr-000211
00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:33.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Siguro we can move to the next slide, I think.

asr-000212
00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:38.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yan po, babalik na lang po ako dun sa previous slide.

asr-000213
00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:45.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kailangan po ng certificate na sinasabi na walang right-of-way issue.

asr-000214
00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:50.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi madalas po ang napansin namin nung kami po ay pumasok late last year

asr-000215
00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:55.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na marami pong mga proyekto ay nare-render unimplementable

asr-000216
00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:57.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dahil po, linalagay ang proyekto sa budget

asr-000217
00:16:57.720 --> 00:16:58.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na

asr-000218
00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:00.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: hindi pa po secure ang right-of-way

asr-000219
00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:03.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: o walang kasigurahan na makukuha ang right-of-way

asr-000220
00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:07.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: within the implementation period of the project.

asr-000221
00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:10.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya po maraming mga nasasayang ng napondo.

asr-000222
00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:14.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So kailangan pong i-certify nung implementation office

asr-000223
00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:17.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na walang right-of-way issues.

asr-000224
00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:21.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kailangan po din lang i-certify na no duplicate projects

asr-000225
00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:22.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dun sa mga project na yan.

asr-000226
00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:25.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ito din po ay madalas na nakikita natin

asr-000227
00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ng mga nakaraang mga taon na madalas

asr-000228
00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:29.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: same project titles,

asr-000229
00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:31.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ilang beses pong lumarabas

asr-000230
00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:32.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa National Expenditure Program.

asr-000231
00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:36.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, kaya i-certify na po ito ng DE

asr-000232
00:17:36.220 --> 00:17:37.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: o ng RD

asr-000233
00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:41.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na wala pong duplicate project po ito.

asr-000234
00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Wala din pong previous funded

asr-000235
00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:46.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: except for yung mga for completion.

asr-000236
00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:50.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At naging stricto na po kami

asr-000237
00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:53.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na kailangan po kung isang project

asr-000238
00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:57.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ay either continuation or for completion

asr-000239
00:17:57.700 --> 00:18:00.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kailangan po nakasaad yan doon sa project title.

asr-000240
00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:04.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Para po nakikita po talaga na ito ay ongoing project

asr-000241
00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:07.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at either tinutuloy or ikokompleto na lang.

asr-000242
00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:11.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And finally po, kagaya po nung geotag locations

asr-000243
00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:14.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kailangan pong i-certify nila

asr-000244
00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:17.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung identified specific locations.

asr-000245
00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:20.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ito po ay pinipirma ng DE

asr-000246
00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:23.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: para po yung accountability ay klarong-klaro.

asr-000247
00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:26.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At kung meron pong madiskubre na problema,

asr-000248
00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:31.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: makikita po ng COA at ng mga investigative authorities

asr-000249
00:18:31.320 --> 00:18:33.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na pinirmaan po mismo yan

asr-000250
00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:35.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at accountable po klaro

asr-000251
00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:37.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang implementing office

asr-000252
00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:40.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: either the DE or the regional director

asr-000253
00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:44.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dahil meron po siyang signed certificate of inventibility.

asr-000254
00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:47.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And ito po ay may kasama na rin pong siyempre

asr-000255
00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:50.400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ano ito, accountability at takot.

asr-000256
00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:53.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi siyempre po, kapag pumirma na po ang DE dyan o RD

asr-000257
00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:57.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: eh matatakot na po yung gumawa ng house shout,

asr-000258
00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:58.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na proyekto.

asr-000259
00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:00.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil po talagang nakapirma na siya dyan

asr-000260
00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:02.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at lahat po yan ay nakasubmit

asr-000261
00:19:02.760 --> 00:19:05.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: bago ipasok sa National Expenditure Program.

asr-000262
00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:10.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Finally po, one slide up, sorry.

asr-000263
00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:19.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kailangan po ang project ay may basihan at may koordinasyon.

asr-000264
00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:25.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unang-una po ang nakita naming naging maraking problema

asr-000265
00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:28.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dun sa mga proyekto pong nababoy

asr-000266
00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:29.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ay unang-una,

asr-000267
00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:30.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yan ay hindi po,

asr-000268
00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:33.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: hindi naging base sa either

asr-000269
00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:37.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: isang existing river basin master plan,

asr-000270
00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:38.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: isang feasibility study,

asr-000271
00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:42.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: o drainage master plan ng isang LGU.

asr-000272
00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:46.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Inaamin po namin at I'm sure po marami pong magtatanong

asr-000273
00:19:46.840 --> 00:19:48.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa ating honorable members,

asr-000274
00:19:48.760 --> 00:19:51.400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ano ang status ng mga iba't ibang master plan?

asr-000275
00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:54.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And I will be able to answer that very clearly po mamaya,

asr-000276
00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:57.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pero sasabihin ko na po ngayon sa presentation ko po pa lang

asr-000277
00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:00.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na hindi pa po kumpleto ang ating master plan.

asr-000278
00:20:01.120 --> 00:20:01.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nationwide.

asr-000279
00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:08.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Marami pong mga river basin master plans natin ay either hindi pa tapos

asr-000280
00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:11.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: or kung tapos man, very outdated na po ito.

asr-000281
00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:17.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Alam naman po natin, given what we have seen with climate change,

asr-000282
00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:22.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: the updating of these master plans is critical because they have a direct impact

asr-000283
00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:26.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: on the engineering designs of the infrastructure that needs to be built.

asr-000284
00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:30.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Halimbawa po, kung ang rainfall, average rainfall natin,

asr-000285
00:20:31.320 --> 00:20:38.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: according to our scientist ex noong 2010, 2013, 2015,

asr-000286
00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:43.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: the years of which marami sa mga master plans natin eh ganun si kakatanda,

asr-000287
00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:50.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: magkakipa na po ang pinagbago niyan 10 years or 15 years after.

asr-000288
00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:54.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And meron po yung direct impact, halimbawa po sa taas ng mga dike,

asr-000289
00:20:54.740 --> 00:21:00.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa taas ng mga dam, sa design ng mga dike, sa design ng mga dam.

asr-000290
00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:03.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa laki po ng mga detention basin.

asr-000291
00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:10.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So hindi po tayo pwedeng basta-basta na lang magbase sa mga lumang mga studies

asr-000292
00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:18.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dahil maraki na po ang pinagbago ng klima 10, 15 years since these plans were completed.

asr-000293
00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:23.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ikalawa po, hindi po lahat ng lugar ay may master plan. Sad to say.

asr-000294
00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:29.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Halimbawa po sa NCR, wala pa po talagang NCR fraud master plan.

asr-000295
00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:36.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Lahat po ito ay ongoing pa pero meron naman pong mga local master plans

asr-000296
00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:38.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: tulad po ng Quezon City, halimbawa.

asr-000297
00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:44.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tulad po ng Maynila, tulad po ng Pasig, Marikina.

asr-000298
00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:46.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron na pong mga master plans yan.

asr-000299
00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:53.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya po puwapasok yung requirement din for either Regional Development Council,

asr-000300
00:21:54.280 --> 00:21:58.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Provincial Development Council, Local Development Council,

asr-000301
00:21:58.620 --> 00:22:00.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: or at the very least

asr-000303
00:22:00.620 --> 00:22:20.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: certificates of no objection from the LGUs para naman po coordinated naman po ang mga proyekto ng DPWH sa ating mga regional, provincial, at local authorities.

asr-000304
00:22:21.660 --> 00:22:36.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi na po masasabi alimbawa ng Quezon City na ni Mayor Joy na daang-daang at bilyong-bilyong mga proyekto na fraud mitigation, eh hindi man lang niya alam.

asr-000305
00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:42.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So hindi na po ipapwede yun kasi required na po itong mga ito. Kailangan po may basehan na.

asr-000306
00:22:44.700 --> 00:22:51.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So yun po, very stringent po yan. At yung mga requirements na yan, ipopost po natin at iaralagay.

asr-000307
00:22:51.740 --> 00:22:55.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Iaralagay po natin para makita po ng publiko for full transparency.

asr-000308
00:22:57.340 --> 00:22:58.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Next slide.

asr-000309
00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:04.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo, importante din po itong budget rationalization and prioritization.

asr-000310
00:23:04.420 --> 00:23:16.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And one major component of this is the rationalization of the convergence and special support program.

asr-000311
00:23:16.860 --> 00:23:20.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Because we also, in the course of our...

asr-000312
00:23:20.120 --> 00:23:33.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pushing for reform, nakita po din namin na itong CSSP na tinatawag, maraming din pong pwedeng gawin para ma-streamline natin, ma-rationalize at ma-reforma.

asr-000313
00:23:33.200 --> 00:23:45.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unang-una po, lahat po ng local projects, kami po ay ginagay na po namin sa isang basic infrastructure program na lang.

asr-000314
00:23:45.740 --> 00:23:46.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Wala na po yung sipag.

asr-000315
00:23:47.460 --> 00:23:50.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So isa na lang po, VIP na lang po tayo para...

asr-000316
00:23:51.180 --> 00:23:53.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: It is also meant to avoid duplication.

asr-000317
00:23:53.180 --> 00:24:02.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil doon po sa mga nakita na din natin, na pinoint out din po ng mga investigations, ay doon din po nang gagaling yung mga duplication.

asr-000318
00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:09.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So simply, the simple solution was just to put everything under the VIP.

asr-000319
00:24:09.860 --> 00:24:18.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We have also instituted the removal of all the convergence programs with the other departments.

asr-000320
00:24:19.000 --> 00:24:20.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya makikita nyo po dyan, halimbawa.

asr-000321
00:24:20.960 --> 00:24:21.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 'no?

asr-000322
00:24:21.140 --> 00:24:25.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang trip program with the tourism department.

asr-000323
00:24:25.960 --> 00:24:27.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tinanggal na po namin yun.

asr-000324
00:24:27.480 --> 00:24:38.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ang sabi po ng DBM, imbes na po sa DPWH ipasok, yung mga programa ng DOT for infrastructure,

asr-000325
00:24:39.700 --> 00:24:42.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: igagay na po either sa TIEZA or sa DOT na.

asr-000326
00:24:43.120 --> 00:24:43.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Bakit po?

asr-000327
00:24:44.040 --> 00:24:49.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil po marami din po kaming narinig at nakita na priority ng DOT,

asr-000328
00:24:49.980 --> 00:24:54.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pero hindi naman po pumapasok sa trip program ng DPWH.

asr-000329
00:24:54.780 --> 00:25:00.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At meron pong mga pumasok sa trip program na hindi naman po priority ng DOT.

asr-000330
00:25:01.200 --> 00:25:04.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kapareho din po ng roll-it program ng DTI.

asr-000331
00:25:05.120 --> 00:25:12.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron pong mga priorities ang DTI na hindi naman po pumapasok sa DPWH roll-it program.

asr-000332
00:25:12.360 --> 00:25:20.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So again, the simple solution was to just lodge all these priority infrastructure programs of DTI,

asr-000333
00:25:21.100 --> 00:25:29.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: DTI, DOT, DOTR, yung katuparan program, and others, sa kanya-kanya na lang po nilang mga department.

asr-000334
00:25:29.920 --> 00:25:34.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At kung gusto po nila na ang DPWH ang mag-implement doon,

asr-000335
00:25:34.440 --> 00:25:41.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: then ita-download na lang po yung pondong yun at magkakaroon na lang po ng memorandum of agreement between the agencies.

asr-000336
00:25:42.360 --> 00:25:49.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Again, to make it more in tune with the priorities of those departments

asr-000337
00:25:49.060 --> 00:25:49.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and

asr-000338
00:25:49.820 --> 00:25:51.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at the same time, for full transparency.

asr-000339
00:25:52.840 --> 00:26:04.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, yun po ang ginawa natin sa convergence and social special support program.

asr-000340
00:26:05.540 --> 00:26:06.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Next slide, please.

asr-000341
00:26:08.460 --> 00:26:11.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Okay, and this is I think important to highlight.

asr-000342
00:26:13.220 --> 00:26:18.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Typically po, ang average projects ng DPWH

asr-000343
00:26:18.240 --> 00:26:21.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ay umaabot ng mahigit.

asr-000344
00:26:21.560 --> 00:26:22.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 20,000 projects.

asr-000345
00:26:22.960 --> 00:26:25.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In the cases po, in 2024 and 2025,

asr-000346
00:26:26.200 --> 00:26:30.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: nung napakataas po, halos isang triyon ang budget ng DPWH,

asr-000347
00:26:31.300 --> 00:26:33.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ay umaabot po yan ng mahigit 25,000 projects.

asr-000348
00:26:34.750 --> 00:26:36.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ngayon po, talaga pong

asr-000349
00:26:36.540 --> 00:26:39.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: nag-sumikap kami

asr-000350
00:26:39.940 --> 00:26:44.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na talagang ibaba po yung number of projects natin.

asr-000351
00:26:44.200 --> 00:26:46.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And there are several reasons for this.

asr-000352
00:26:47.060 --> 00:26:48.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unang-una po is, number one,

asr-000353
00:26:48.480 --> 00:26:49.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: number one,

asr-000354
00:26:49.300 --> 00:26:54.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: we eliminated or tried our best

asr-000355
00:26:54.160 --> 00:26:59.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: to eliminate all duplicate projects, number one,

asr-000356
00:26:59.300 --> 00:27:01.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and all overlapping projects.

asr-000357
00:27:02.100 --> 00:27:03.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Number two,

asr-000358
00:27:03.780 --> 00:27:07.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: we really wanted to focus on the big ticket projects

asr-000359
00:27:08.100 --> 00:27:13.400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and bring down the number of small ticket projects.

asr-000360
00:27:13.640 --> 00:27:16.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In fact po, for the BIP program,

asr-000361
00:27:16.560 --> 00:27:17.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: of course, this is still,

asr-000362
00:27:18.080 --> 00:27:21.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: we leave it up to the wisdom of the committee on this.

asr-000363
00:27:21.320 --> 00:27:23.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But BPM mandated to us,

asr-000364
00:27:23.760 --> 00:27:25.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: under the BIP program,

asr-000365
00:27:25.940 --> 00:27:30.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: to remove all projects below 5 million pesos.

asr-000366
00:27:31.560 --> 00:27:34.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And that also drastically reduced the number of projects.

asr-000367
00:27:34.800 --> 00:27:37.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And I think the third is also very important.

asr-000368
00:27:38.040 --> 00:27:40.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Alam niyo po, Mr. Chairman, Honorable Members,

asr-000369
00:27:42.040 --> 00:27:44.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: nung pong pumasok ako sa DPWH,

asr-000370
00:27:44.840 --> 00:27:48.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: isa po sa mga unang tinanong ko sa ating mga implementing offices

asr-000371
00:27:48.960 --> 00:27:50.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: is,

asr-000372
00:27:50.000 --> 00:27:51.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ano ba,

asr-000373
00:27:51.220 --> 00:27:55.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang ideal number of projects na dapat ini-implement

asr-000374
00:27:55.800 --> 00:28:00.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ng ating mga implementation offices,

asr-000375
00:28:00.720 --> 00:28:05.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung ating pong mga district engineers and regional directors.

asr-000376
00:28:05.820 --> 00:28:08.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi syempre po, kung ako'y district engineer,

asr-000377
00:28:08.160 --> 00:28:09.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: halimbawa, sa isang distrito,

asr-000378
00:28:10.060 --> 00:28:11.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: say, sa Iloilo po,

asr-000379
00:28:12.200 --> 00:28:16.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kay Deputy Speaker Janet,

asr-000380
00:28:16.700 --> 00:28:17.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: no,

asr-000381
00:28:17.380 --> 00:28:20.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: bilang isang district office or district engineer,

asr-000382
00:28:20.100 --> 00:28:21.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: meron din po,

asr-000383
00:28:21.500 --> 00:28:24.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kung absorptive capacity ang distritong iyon.

asr-000384
00:28:24.780 --> 00:28:28.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meaning, there is a limit to the number of projects

asr-000385
00:28:28.560 --> 00:28:35.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: that can be implemented by a district engineer or a regional office.

asr-000386
00:28:36.320 --> 00:28:42.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nalaman ko po, na lampas-lampas na po pala sa ideal number.

asr-000387
00:28:42.620 --> 00:28:45.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I think up to, you say, up to what?

asr-000388
00:28:45.520 --> 00:28:47.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Triple, quadruple?

asr-000389
00:28:47.180 --> 00:28:50.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In some case, triple, quadruple the ideal.

asr-000390
00:28:51.380 --> 00:28:55.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kunyari po, ang ideal po na ini-implement lang

asr-000391
00:28:55.080 --> 00:28:57.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ng isang district engineering office ay,

asr-000392
00:28:57.160 --> 00:28:58.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sabihin natin,

asr-000393
00:28:58.480 --> 00:29:01.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: isang daang proyekto lang,

asr-000394
00:29:02.100 --> 00:29:05.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: umaabot na po ng times three, times four.

asr-000395
00:29:06.580 --> 00:29:10.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, sinikap din po namin na iba ba ito,

asr-000396
00:29:10.300 --> 00:29:13.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kaya po nakikita nyo yung dramatic change

asr-000397
00:29:13.760 --> 00:29:15.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa number of projects, no?

asr-000398
00:29:15.760 --> 00:29:20.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa number of projects ng DPWH,

asr-000399
00:29:20.320 --> 00:29:22.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: because of those three reasons.

asr-000400
00:29:23.940 --> 00:29:27.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And I think this is very important po, moving forward.

asr-000401
00:29:28.420 --> 00:29:29.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Next slide, please.

asr-000402
00:29:29.700 --> 00:29:33.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Now, let me go po to the allocations per region.

asr-000403
00:29:33.460 --> 00:29:41.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In the last 10 years po, the average allocation for Luzon, Visayas, Mindanao,

asr-000404
00:29:41.320 --> 00:29:43.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and we can provide for the regional breakdowns of this,

asr-000405
00:29:43.980 --> 00:29:47.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: is roughly 56% in Luzon,

asr-000406
00:29:47.880 --> 00:29:50.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 27% in Mindanao,

asr-000407
00:29:50.580 --> 00:29:53.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and only 17% in the Visayas.

asr-000408
00:29:53.620 --> 00:29:55.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: No, what we tried to do po,

asr-000409
00:29:56.020 --> 00:29:58.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dahil nga po we wanted to make this more needs-

asr-000410
00:30:07.220 --> 00:30:10.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ito na po yung ating breakdown ngayon for 2027.

asr-000411
00:30:10.300 --> 00:30:16.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We brought it down po sa Luzon from 56% average over the last 10 years.

asr-000412
00:30:16.680 --> 00:30:20.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: It is now down to 52% roughly.

asr-000413
00:30:22.880 --> 00:30:27.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Visayas is now at 20% from only 70% on average.

asr-000414
00:30:27.300 --> 00:30:30.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In the last 10 years.

asr-000415
00:30:30.500 --> 00:30:36.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And Mindanao po is a little lower po na 27 point.

asr-000416
00:30:37.620 --> 00:30:39.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sorry, it's the same at 28%.

asr-000417
00:30:39.880 --> 00:30:49.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So we tried our best po to really make the budget for 2027 more equitable and more needs-based.

asr-000418
00:30:49.120 --> 00:30:59.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In fact po, and I'm looking, we tried to look at also the regions with the,

asr-000419
00:30:59.040 --> 00:31:11.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: highest poverty incidences, namely Region 5, Region 8, Region 13, and Region 9.

asr-000420
00:31:12.140 --> 00:31:18.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And tinaas po namin yung budgets din po relative to previous budgets.

asr-000421
00:31:18.500 --> 00:31:20.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We can provide po the data.

asr-000422
00:31:25.040 --> 00:31:31.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So we know that this is not, still not perfect or it is not,

asr-000423
00:31:31.360 --> 00:31:35.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: equitable enough, but we tried our best po to start o rin.

asr-000424
00:31:35.620 --> 00:31:37.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Trying to make the budget more equitable.

asr-000425
00:31:37.840 --> 00:31:42.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But this is a process that will require several years po of correcting,

asr-000426
00:31:42.780 --> 00:31:46.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: which we believe was, you know, quite a, pasensya na po, no?

asr-000427
00:31:46.700 --> 00:31:50.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: A more Luzon-centric budget, no?

asr-000428
00:31:51.420 --> 00:31:58.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And really try to make the budget more equitable for the regions that really need it the most.

asr-000429
00:31:58.800 --> 00:32:01.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Especially in the poorest regions of 5.

asr-000430
00:32:01.580 --> 00:32:05.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 8, 13, et cetera, and 9, no?

asr-000431
00:32:06.240 --> 00:32:10.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Para po naman yung mga mas nangangailangan, e, mas mataas ang kanilang pondo.

asr-000432
00:32:10.800 --> 00:32:15.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: This we feel is a good start, but personally po, this is still not enough.

asr-000433
00:32:15.760 --> 00:32:18.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And we will leave it again up to the wisdom of Congress.

asr-000434
00:32:18.800 --> 00:32:25.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: If you feel that we need to reallocate some more in order to really address the needs,

asr-000435
00:32:25.000 --> 00:32:30.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: especially of regions and provinces and areas that need it the most.

asr-000436
00:32:33.200 --> 00:32:34.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Next slide, please.

asr-000437
00:32:34.900 --> 00:32:38.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And let me now go po to flood mitigation, no?

asr-000438
00:32:38.080 --> 00:32:45.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And what the reforms we have tried to initiate, started to initiate,

asr-000439
00:32:45.380 --> 00:32:51.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and hopefully we will be able to continue to initiate with the help of Congress in the coming months.

asr-000440
00:32:51.680 --> 00:32:56.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: As we implement the budget that will be eventually passed by Congress.

asr-000441
00:32:58.220 --> 00:33:02.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And these are po the six pillars of our...

asr-000442
00:33:02.920 --> 00:33:06.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: reforms with respect to flood mitigation.

asr-000443
00:33:06.140 --> 00:33:12.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I just want to emphasize, no, that we will try not to use the word flood control anymore.

asr-000444
00:33:13.140 --> 00:33:19.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: No, we are, we have had a lot of conversations po with the experts, specifically Project NOAA.

asr-000445
00:33:19.720 --> 00:33:26.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And we agree with them that we need to use better terminology because words matter and terms matter.

asr-000446
00:33:27.180 --> 00:33:30.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And it's really about flood mitigation or flood management.

asr-000447
00:33:30.920 --> 00:33:32.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi po, yung control po...

asr-000448
00:33:32.800 --> 00:33:38.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: It sends, I think, a wrong message kasi hindi naman po natin talaga makokontrol ang pagbahay.

asr-000449
00:33:38.560 --> 00:33:47.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nakita naman po natin kahit sa mga mayayamang bansa, binabaha po sila despite the top class, world class infrastructure in Japan, in other countries.

asr-000450
00:33:48.280 --> 00:33:49.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron pa rin pong bahay.

asr-000451
00:33:49.840 --> 00:33:56.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: No, I think we really need to focus on what we can do to mitigate para maibsan po natin yung nararamdaman natin.

asr-000452
00:33:57.040 --> 00:34:03.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Obviously po, ang dami po nating problema all over the country which we have seen just in the past couple of...

asr-000453
00:34:03.240 --> 00:34:05.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: of weeks and months.

asr-000454
00:34:05.720 --> 00:34:10.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But I think, no, it's very important na gamitin po natin yung tamang terminology.

asr-000455
00:34:10.880 --> 00:34:16.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And according to the experts, especially Project NOAA, flood mitigation is really the proper term.

asr-000456
00:34:16.700 --> 00:34:23.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, ito po yung ating mga reforms, no, na sinisimulan na natin.

asr-000457
00:34:24.000 --> 00:34:25.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi pa ito perfect.

asr-000458
00:34:25.720 --> 00:34:28.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: That's why we will need the help of Congress for this.

asr-000459
00:34:28.440 --> 00:34:33.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And we will need the help of our provinces, our LGUs.

asr-000460
00:34:33.500 --> 00:34:35.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: To help us implement this.

asr-000461
00:34:35.560 --> 00:34:39.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But we are trying our best to start with these six pillars.

asr-000462
00:34:39.560 --> 00:34:44.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Number one po ay, kailangan po based na sa mga plano.

asr-000463
00:34:46.100 --> 00:34:48.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Inaamin po natin na hindi pa kumpleto ang plano.

asr-000464
00:34:49.000 --> 00:34:50.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi pa updated ang mga plano.

asr-000465
00:34:51.040 --> 00:34:54.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Maraming mga area na wala pang plan at all.

asr-000466
00:34:55.140 --> 00:34:56.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Wala pa pong plano.

asr-000467
00:34:56.660 --> 00:35:02.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Halimbawa po, sa ibang major river basins natin, wala pa pong master plan.

asr-000468
00:35:02.940 --> 00:35:08.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: No, there are really just a handful of major river basins na meron ng master plan.

asr-000469
00:35:09.160 --> 00:35:10.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: No, marami pa pong wala.

asr-000470
00:35:10.480 --> 00:35:13.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Marami po po mga LGUs na wala pang drainage master plan.

asr-000471
00:35:14.140 --> 00:35:20.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya, importante din po na hingin po namin din ang tulong ng ating committee at ng kongreso.

asr-000472
00:35:20.780 --> 00:35:28.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sana po, bigyan tayo ng mas maraking pondo for project studies, feasibility studies, and master planning.

asr-000473
00:35:28.560 --> 00:35:31.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi po, in the past budgets, napansin ko po,

asr-000474
00:35:31.460 --> 00:35:33.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: mababa po.

asr-000475
00:35:33.300 --> 00:35:38.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang naibibigay sa DPWH for feasibility studies, detailed engineering.

asr-000476
00:35:39.040 --> 00:35:41.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At dahil po doon, nagsasuffer din po talaga.

asr-000477
00:35:42.440 --> 00:35:46.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi lang ng pagpaplano ng mga proyekto, kundi yung pag-implement ng mga proyekto.

asr-000478
00:35:48.240 --> 00:35:59.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ikalawa po, we need po to focus on closing the gaps and finishing unfinished flood mitigation projects.

asr-000479
00:35:59.140 --> 00:36:02.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nakikita na po natin ngayon yan all over the country.

asr-000480
00:36:02.900 --> 00:36:04.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At nakakalungkot po talaga.

asr-000481
00:36:04.780 --> 00:36:14.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Marami sa mga nasangkot na damay sa flood control scandal ay unfinished.

asr-000482
00:36:16.360 --> 00:36:17.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Halos lahat po ay unfinished.

asr-000483
00:36:18.060 --> 00:36:24.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang problema po dyan, kapag ang isang halimbawa, isang dike ay unfinished, meron po yung butas.

asr-000484
00:36:25.440 --> 00:36:31.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tumatango po ang ating kaibigan at si Honorable Congressman Toby Chanko sa navotas.

asr-000485
00:36:31.660 --> 00:36:33.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Example po ang navotas dyan.

asr-000486
00:36:33.520 --> 00:36:34.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang dami pong mga butas,

asr-000487
00:36:34.940 --> 00:36:35.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: mga gaps.

asr-000488
00:36:36.140 --> 00:36:42.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya po nung ako po ay pumasok, sa unang-una pong tumawag sa akin ay si Kong Toby.

asr-000489
00:36:42.420 --> 00:36:46.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ang unang-una po niyang hiningi ay isarado ang mga gap.

asr-000490
00:36:47.340 --> 00:36:49.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ginawan po natin ang paraan.

asr-000491
00:36:49.640 --> 00:36:55.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nag-anap po tayo from savings, nag-reprioritize po tayo para isara ang lahat ng gaps ng navotas.

asr-000492
00:36:55.560 --> 00:37:01.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ang naging immediate effect po noon, especially po, kasama na rin po yung pagpapagawa ng pumping station at mga flood gates,

asr-000493
00:37:02.860 --> 00:37:04.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: halos wala pong bahasan.

asr-000494
00:37:04.920 --> 00:37:08.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang dami pong mga butas this year and I think Congressman Toby can attest to that.

asr-000495
00:37:08.460 --> 00:37:11.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero all over the country po, ang daming butas.

asr-000496
00:37:11.320 --> 00:37:12.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang daming gaps.

asr-000497
00:37:12.460 --> 00:37:15.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang problema po dyan, kapag ang isa pong revetment, alimbawa, ay may gap.

asr-000498
00:37:16.180 --> 00:37:19.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At alam po nung ating mga, tumatango po ang ating mga members dito.

asr-000499
00:37:20.380 --> 00:37:24.400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pag tinamaan po ng bahayan, sigurado po, 100%.

asr-000500
00:37:24.860 --> 00:37:26.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kahit hindi pa substandard yan.

asr-000501
00:37:26.680 --> 00:37:28.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kahit maayos pang pagkagawa niyan.

asr-000502
00:37:28.740 --> 00:37:31.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kung yan ay may butas, yan po ay masisira.

asr-000503
00:37:31.960 --> 00:37:34.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil po, pag ang gap ay pinasok ng tubig,

asr-000504
00:37:35.300 --> 00:37:39.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: papasok po ang tubig doon sa gap na yan at wawasakin po niya yung deking.

asr-000505
00:37:39.640 --> 00:37:43.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At yun po ang nakikita na natin na nangyayari all over the country.

asr-000506
00:37:43.440 --> 00:37:47.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya very critical po, ang pagsasara ng mga gaps na yan.

asr-000507
00:37:47.520 --> 00:37:52.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At medyo, hirap din po kami dahil tali po ang kamay namin sa DPWH.

asr-000508
00:37:52.740 --> 00:37:53.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Bakit?

asr-000509
00:37:53.420 --> 00:38:01.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil po marami sa mga may gap din ay subject ng investigations po ng iba't ibang ahensya.

asr-000510
00:38:01.440 --> 00:38:03.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tulad ng ombudsman ng DOJ, ng NBI.

asr-000511
00:38:04.400 --> 00:38:05.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ng COA.

asr-000512
00:38:05.500 --> 00:38:07.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At kapag po subject ng investigation,

asr-000513
00:38:08.680 --> 00:38:13.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: hindi po natin basta-basta na lang mapapagawa yung mga proyektong yan.

asr-000514
00:38:13.480 --> 00:38:15.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Halimbawa po, sa Bulacan po,

asr-000515
00:38:16.700 --> 00:38:21.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na kailangan-kailangan talaga dahil diyan po yung karamihang mga binaboy na proyekto.

asr-000516
00:38:21.660 --> 00:38:26.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hirap na hirap po kami magpaayos ng mga proyektong nababoy.

asr-000517
00:38:26.640 --> 00:38:31.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil po, isang katutak po na proseso at requirements po ng COA

asr-000518
00:38:31.620 --> 00:38:34.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: para po makakuha ng COA clearance para ma-

asr-000519
00:38:34.300 --> 00:38:36.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: simulan ng pag-repairs.

asr-000520
00:38:36.380 --> 00:38:40.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya po, humihingi din po kami ng tulong sa committee, sa kongreso.

asr-000521
00:38:40.260 --> 00:38:42.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Baka po matulungan kami dyan.

asr-000522
00:38:42.180 --> 00:38:45.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil po, kahit gusto naming ayusin ang mga gap na ito,

asr-000523
00:38:45.920 --> 00:38:48.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kung ito po ay subject ng investigation lalo na,

asr-000524
00:38:48.420 --> 00:38:53.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at subject ng COA, either suspension or disallowance na,

asr-000525
00:38:54.520 --> 00:38:56.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: hindi po namin magawa yan ang basta-basta.

asr-000526
00:38:57.760 --> 00:39:00.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ikatlo po, kailangan po, gaya ng sinabi ko kanina,

asr-000527
00:39:00.940 --> 00:39:03.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: lahat ay may kailangang approved plan na.

asr-000528
00:39:04.600 --> 00:39:09.400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi na po pe pwede na project title lang at cost.

asr-000529
00:39:10.250 --> 00:39:11.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ganyan po ang nangyari dati.

asr-000530
00:39:12.600 --> 00:39:13.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unfortunately.

asr-000531
00:39:13.960 --> 00:39:15.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ngayon po, hindi na po pe pwede yan.

asr-000532
00:39:17.220 --> 00:39:21.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ikatlo po, gusto din po namin mag-focus on integrated water resource management.

asr-000533
00:39:21.780 --> 00:39:23.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya importante din po sa amin,

asr-000534
00:39:23.580 --> 00:39:28.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang pagpapagawa ng mga detention at retarding basins at mga dams,

asr-000535
