asr-000543
00:40:00.540 --> 00:40:03.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: hindi lang po yung ginagawa sa opisina,

asr-000544
00:40:03.920 --> 00:40:10.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pero kailangan po talaga may retrato at nandun mismo sa area kung saan pinagkuhan.

