asr-000753
00:58:52.040 --> 00:58:52.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Na-overloaded.

asr-000754
00:58:53.320 --> 00:58:56.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero dahil, I think it's a 46-year-old bridge.

asr-000755
