DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: hindi po natin na paayos yan temporarily.

asr-000757
00:59:05.420 --> 00:59:08.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero we cannot, we don't have enough money to keep on doing that

asr-000758
00:59:08.540 --> 00:59:11.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: every time a bridge collapses or a bridge needs retrofitting.

asr-000759
00:59:12.880 --> 00:59:14.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yung pong Tagloan Bridge.

asr-000760
00:59:16.680 --> 00:59:18.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Eight years na po yung kailangan i-retrofit.

asr-000761
00:59:20.400 --> 00:59:23.480
