DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero kailangan namin gagyan ng augmentation

asr-000764
00:59:28.780 --> 00:59:32.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: para masigurado na by end of this year,

asr-000765
00:59:32.080 --> 00:59:34.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: matatapos na yung bridge.

asr-000766
00:59:34.180 --> 00:59:36.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kung hindi po natin nagagyan ng augmentation yan for savings,

asr-000767
00:59:36.900 --> 00:59:41.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: maghihintay na naman po ng siguro dagawang taon pa.

asr-000768
00:59:41.520 --> 00:59:43.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Magiging yung eight years, magiging ten years po.

asr-000769
00:59:44.380 --> 00:59:49.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero mamamatay na po sa traffic ang mga bumabiyahe sa distrito ni DS Bambi.

asr-000770
00:59:50.000 --> 00:59:52.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I saw it for myself with my own eyes.

asr-000771
00:59:52.880 --> 00:59:53.400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Halos po.

asr-000772
00:59:53.400 --> 00:59:56.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tatlong kilometro po yung traffic ng papuntang butuan and back.

asr-000773
00:59:59.460 --> 01:00:09.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa summer po, kung nandito po si Kakong Mike, yung Calviga Bridge, yung Giloan Bridge, sarado po yan.

asr-000774
01:00:09.900 --> 01:00:14.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero ginamitan po natin ang augmentation at ng savings para po mapagawa na.

asr-000775
01:00:15.320 --> 01:00:18.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ngayon po, nabuksa na po natin, na-retrofit na po natin ang Calviga.

asr-000776
01:00:19.100 --> 01:00:25.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I think it took five years, I think. Five years na pong nakasarayan.

asr-000777
01:00:27.480 --> 01:00:29.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, kailangan-kailangan po talaga ito.

asr-000778
01:00:29.540 --> 01:00:37.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And knock on wood po, pero ano po talaga, marami pong masisira.

asr-000779
