DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Just simply because of age of these bridges.

asr-000780
01:00:42.280 --> 01:00:47.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Marami po sa mga bridges na ito, nung time pa po ni Pangulong Ferdinand Marcos Sr. pa nagawa.

asr-000781
01:00:48.340 --> 01:00:52.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, you're talking about bridges po that were built in the 60s and the 70s.

asr-000782
01:00:52.400 --> 01:00:54.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And they have not been retrofitted since then.

asr-000783
01:00:54.960 --> 01:00:57.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: They have not been replaced since then.

asr-000784
01:00:57.320 --> 01:01:04.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And unfortunately, they have already, they are already have or about to outlive their life.

asr-000785
01:01:04.760 --> 01:01:12.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Lalo na po, marami din po tayong problema sa mga overloaded na trucks na hindi din po nakokontrol.

asr-000786
01:01:13.100 --> 01:01:18.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Halimbawa po sa pag-itatikatan, dalawa pong 80-ton trucks ang sabay na dumaan dyan.

asr-000787
01:01:19.000 --> 01:01:21.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: One from each side. Kaya po talaga bumagsak yan.

asr-000788
01:01:22.840 --> 01:01:25.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And that is a 46-year-old bridge.

asr-000789
01:01:25.740 --> 01:01:28.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, ano po, kailangan po talaga ito.

asr-000790
01:01:31.520 --> 01:01:36.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And finally, ito po, obviously, the flood mitigation master plan.

asr-000791
01:01:38.320 --> 01:01:43.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And these are just examples po of the flood mitigation or flood management.

asr-000792
01:01:43.660 --> 01:01:49.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And these are things po that we tried to immediately repair and rehabilitate.

asr-000793
01:01:49.840 --> 01:01:55.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nasabi ko na po yung sanavotas na inayos po natin, again, through augmentation and savings.

asr-000794
01:01:56.020 --> 01:01:58.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We are right now rebuilding.

asr-000795
01:01:58.140 --> 01:01:59.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We are rebuilding the seawall in Albay.

asr-000796
01:02:02.020 --> 01:02:06.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Next po, we are doing various open kontrabaha.

asr-000797
01:02:06.940 --> 01:02:09.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: By the way, these are all unfunded po.

asr-000798
01:02:09.200 --> 01:02:16.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We are just trying to use whatever funds that we have from savings for open kontrabaha.

asr-000799
01:02:18.740 --> 01:02:22.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: By the way po, if I may emphasize on this.

asr-000800
01:02:22.480 --> 01:02:28.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dredging po and desilting of rivers is critical to flood mitigation and management.

asr-000801
01:02:29.120 --> 01:02:40.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unfortunately po, for the last, I think, more than 12 years, and Chairman Romy po can attest to this,

asr-000802
01:02:40.060 --> 01:02:44.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: halos wala pong dredging at desilting na ginawa ang DPWH.

asr-000803
01:02:45.260 --> 01:02:47.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Lalo na sa mga major rivers.

asr-000804
01:02:47.280 --> 01:02:53.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: That is 12 years na napuno na po ang ating mga waterways at rivers.

asr-000805
01:02:54.520 --> 01:02:55.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At dahil po dyan,

asr-000806
01:02:56.660 --> 01:02:57.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Baha po talaga,

asr-000807
01:02:57.840 --> 01:02:58.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Lahat.

asr-000808
01:02:59.380 --> 01:03:01.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang imbawa po, I'll just give a few examples.

asr-000809
01:03:02.480 --> 01:03:07.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa Bicol, sa Naga, which is a Camarines Sur, which is a major basin.

asr-000810
01:03:08.040 --> 01:03:09.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dyan po lahat ng bagsak ng tubig ng Bicol.

asr-000811
01:03:10.940 --> 01:03:13.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa catch basin po ang Camarines Sur at Naga.

asr-000812
01:03:15.400 --> 01:03:20.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sinabi po sa akin ni Gov, nila Mayor, nung ating mga congressman dyan,

asr-000813
01:03:20.460 --> 01:03:23.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: wala pong dredging dyan na nangyari in the last 10 years.

asr-000814
01:03:24.020 --> 01:03:24.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Wala po talaga.

asr-000815
01:03:25.980 --> 01:03:27.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ngayon lang po tayo nagsisimula.

asr-000816
01:03:28.120 --> 01:03:33.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero ang problema po, wala ding pondo. So we are made to also resort to augmentation and savings for this.

asr-000817
01:03:34.940 --> 01:03:51.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa Jensan po at sa Davao, nung ako po'y pumunta sa Talomo at sa Makar sa Jensan, yung river po sa Makar sa Jensan, kung ikaw po ay tatayo sa riverbed, maaabot nyo na po yung tulay.

asr-000818
01:03:51.660 --> 01:04:03.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ako, hindi naman po ako congressman Richard Gomez na matangkat. Mag-iitgang po ako. Pero naaabot ko po mismo yung tulay from the riverbed.

asr-000819
01:04:04.760 --> 01:04:15.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Gano'n na po kasilted yung Makar sa Jensan. Wala pong dredging na nangyari doon. At I'm sure po lahat tayo dito, all over, kailangan po natin mag-dredge.

asr-000820
01:04:15.500 --> 01:04:20.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi kung wala pong dredging, 10-12 years na po yan, nasisilt ang ating mga waterways.

asr-000821
01:04:21.520 --> 01:04:25.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tagal ka pong babae ng mga areas. Kasi wala na pong pupuntahan ng tubig.

asr-000822
01:04:25.780 --> 01:04:34.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ngayon naman po, yung ating mga success stories, just in a couple of months since we launched it in late November, itong open contra baja natin,

asr-000823
01:04:35.340 --> 01:04:41.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: we have anecdotal stories from Cagayan, for example po, sa Tugay Garaw.

asr-000824
01:04:43.580 --> 01:04:48.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Na-minimize po ang baha sa Tugay Garaw. Dahil po talagang grabe po ang dredging natin since December dyan.

asr-000825
01:04:49.160 --> 01:04:50.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa mouth ng Tugay Garaw Riverbed.

asr-000826
01:04:51.580 --> 01:04:54.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: However, dahil po dyan, lumalabas na po ang tubig.

asr-000827
01:04:56.380 --> 01:04:58.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ganyan din po ang nakikita natin sa ibang lugar.

asr-000828
01:04:58.720 --> 01:05:00.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, we really just have to...

asr-000829
01:05:00.500 --> 01:05:03.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa Maguindanao din po, sabi po ni Congressman Toto, Mangudadato,

asr-000830
01:05:04.160 --> 01:05:09.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang laki po nang nakita nilang improvement sa levels ng floodwaters.

asr-000831
01:05:10.260 --> 01:05:12.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And typically po, ang Central Mindanao, grabe po ang baha dyan.

asr-000832
01:05:13.780 --> 01:05:21.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil dyan po lahat ng bagsak ng tubig from Central Mindanao, from Bukidnon, Davao, Cotabato, dyan po lahat.

asr-000833
01:05:21.200 --> 01:05:23.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa Mindanao at sa Cotabato, ang bagsak ng tubig.

asr-000834
01:05:24.700 --> 01:05:27.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, we really need to do more of this.

asr-000835
01:05:28.400 --> 01:05:31.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And, of course, we have other special support programs.

asr-000836
01:05:32.260 --> 01:05:34.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In particular po, and I just want to emphasize this,

asr-000837
01:05:35.580 --> 01:05:41.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: marami po tayong mga bridge, sa limbawa, ditong sa Bungabong sa Oriental Mindoro.

asr-000838
01:05:42.280 --> 01:05:44.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And we have seen this all on social media.

asr-000839
01:05:44.640 --> 01:05:48.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: These are bridges that are just being built by the communities.

asr-000840
01:05:49.540 --> 01:05:51.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mostly being used by students.

asr-000841
01:05:52.140 --> 01:05:54.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We have to fix this po.

asr-000842
01:05:54.220 --> 01:05:58.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron po kaming ginawa nito sa Adno sa Pangasinan.

asr-000843
01:05:58.060 --> 01:06:00.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I don't know if we have pictures of that.

asr-000844
01:06:00.300 --> 01:06:03.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But, nakakaawa po talaga.

asr-000845
01:06:03.000 --> 01:06:04.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And we need a program for this.

asr-000846
01:06:04.680 --> 01:06:06.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: To build these makeshift bridges.

asr-000847
01:06:06.820 --> 01:06:11.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And to already build very long, yung mga tatagal na pong mga tulay na matibay na.

asr-000848
01:06:11.940 --> 01:06:15.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Para po sa mga studyante, para sa mga communities po,

asr-000849
01:06:15.720 --> 01:06:18.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na makakadaan po ang tao, makakadaan po ang trice.

asr-000850
01:06:18.740 --> 01:06:23.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Para po si Kel, para lang po madaanan ang mga iba't-ibang mga kababayan na.

asr-000851
01:06:26.080 --> 01:06:28.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And finally po, yung National Building Program.

asr-000852
01:06:29.880 --> 01:06:33.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: This is the last slide po, Mr. Pasensya na po, medyo tumagal.

asr-000853
01:06:33.760 --> 01:06:38.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nakailangan din po natin, marami pong mga unfinished na buildings tayo.

asr-000854
01:06:39.460 --> 01:06:41.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: From national to local.

asr-000855
01:06:41.560 --> 01:06:46.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At yun nga po, nakakagungkot lang po dahil sa sobrang dami,

asr-000856
01:06:46.900 --> 01:06:50.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kailangan din po talagang i-prioritize kung ano ang uunahin.

asr-000857
01:06:50.940 --> 01:06:55.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya kailangan po talaga ang priority natin, yung mga ongoing para po matapos na.

asr-000858
01:06:56.400 --> 01:07:00.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Marami po dyan, from national government agencies to schools, to hospitals,

asr-000859
01:07:02.660 --> 01:07:09.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: to multi-purpose buildings all over the country, kailangan po natin tapusin yan.

asr-000860
01:07:09.840 --> 01:07:17.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, and this is where we will need your help po para ma-prioritize at masigurado pong matapos ang mga building na ito.

asr-000861
01:07:18.240 --> 01:07:19.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Again po,

asr-000862
01:07:19.480 --> 01:07:21.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We submit to the wisdom of Congress.

asr-000863
01:07:22.180 --> 01:07:23.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: This is our proposal.

asr-000864
01:07:23.660 --> 01:07:26.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: It is by no means perfect.

asr-000865
01:07:26.860 --> 01:07:28.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi po namin sinasabi yun.

asr-000866
01:07:28.580 --> 01:07:36.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But we feel that it is a start really to try and institute these long and much needed reforms in the DPWH.

asr-000867
01:07:37.000 --> 01:07:44.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Not only to ensure na maproteksyonan ng pera ng mga kababayan natin from what we have seen already in the past.

asr-000868
01:07:45.260 --> 01:07:49.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And I'm not just talking about the recent flood control scandal.

asr-000869
01:07:49.140 --> 01:07:56.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But also to really build the right infrastructure na talagang kailangan po ng mga kababayan natin.

asr-000870
01:07:56.500 --> 01:08:02.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: With that po, Mr. Chairman, honorable members, I will end my presentation.

asr-000871
01:08:02.180 --> 01:08:08.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But any additional information po, we will provide immediately po to the honorable members of the committee.

asr-000872
01:08:09.080 --> 01:08:10.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Maraming maraming salamat po.

asr-000873
01:08:12.360 --> 01:08:16.700
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you. Thank you very much, Secretary Vince, for that very short presentation.

asr-000874
01:08:17.660 --> 01:08:20.580
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And before we proceed with the question and answer,

asr-000875
01:08:20.780 --> 01:08:27.520
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: I would like to remind our distinguished colleague that each member is given five minutes for questioning and interpellation,

asr-000876
01:08:28.120 --> 01:08:30.420
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: excluding the response of the resource person.

asr-000877
01:08:30.800 --> 01:08:37.840
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And when you hear the bell sound, it means you have only 30 seconds to wind up with your question.

asr-000878
01:08:38.000 --> 01:08:48.760
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And as part of a longstanding and respected tradition of the House of Representatives to accord preferential treatment to the minority members of the House,

asr-000879
01:08:48.760 --> 01:08:54.580
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: and followed by the independent and majority members in alternating manner.

asr-000880
01:08:55.040 --> 01:09:02.580
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Before we'll call on the first member of the House to ask questions from the minority,

asr-000881
01:09:02.580 --> 01:09:08.400
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: I would like to request our Comsec to acknowledge those who came in late.

asr-000882
01:09:09.700 --> 01:09:13.020
Committee Secretary: We would like to acknowledge additional members present,

asr-000883
