Committee Secretary: Vice Chair Cha Hernandez,

asr-000886
01:09:19.360 --> 01:09:21.500
Committee Secretary: Vice Chair Maria Cristina Lopez,

asr-000887
01:09:21.960 --> 01:09:23.980
Committee Secretary: Vice Chair Ompong Ordañez,

asr-000888
