Committee Secretary: Rep. Sarah Elago,

asr-000889
01:09:25.760 --> 01:09:27.820
Committee Secretary: Rep. Shirlyn Bañas-Nograles,

asr-000890
01:09:27.820 --> 01:09:29.220
Committee Secretary: Rep. Zaldy Villa,

asr-000891
01:09:29.520 --> 01:09:31.060
Committee Secretary: Rep. Jess Marquez

asr-000892
01:09:31.400 --> 01:09:33.160
Committee Secretary: Rep. B1 Beltran,

asr-000893
01:09:33.440 --> 01:09:35.980
Committee Secretary: Deputy Minority Leader Antonio Tinio,

asr-000894
01:09:36.260 --> 01:09:38.940
Committee Secretary: Rep. Christine Singson Mijan,

asr-000895
01:09:39.180 --> 01:09:40.740
Committee Secretary: Rep. Jay Vergara,

asr-000896
01:09:41.060 --> 01:09:42.280
Committee Secretary: Rep. Kokoy Salvador,

asr-000897
01:09:42.960 --> 01:09:45.080
Committee Secretary: Vice Chair Lollipop Ouano-Dizon,

asr-000898
01:09:45.380 --> 01:09:47.120
Committee Secretary: Vice Chair Lolita Javier

asr-000899
01:09:47.460 --> 01:09:49.120
Committee Secretary: Rep. Timothy Cayton

asr-000900
01:09:49.440 --> 01:09:51.080
Committee Secretary: Rep. De Carlo Uy,

asr-000901
01:09:51.220 --> 01:09:53.780
Committee Secretary: Rep. Amado Carlos Bolilia,

asr-000902
01:09:54.060 --> 01:09:55.420
Committee Secretary: Rep. Antonino Roman

asr-000903
01:09:55.720 --> 01:09:56.960
Committee Secretary: Rep. Arlyn Ayon,

asr-000904
01:09:57.040 --> 01:09:57.740
Committee Secretary: and Rep. Michael Carlos Dy.

asr-000905
01:10:01.000 --> 01:10:05.220
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And to start with the question and answer from the minority,

asr-000906
01:10:05.420 --> 01:10:10.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: I would like to call on our minority leader, Marcelino Libanan.

asr-000907
01:10:13.240 --> 01:10:15.220
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000908
01:10:16.480 --> 01:10:22.630
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Chairman, salamat sa magandang presentation ng

asr-000909
01:10:22.640 --> 01:10:28.550
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Secretary of Public Works and Highways.

asr-000910
01:10:28.560 --> 01:10:33.080
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Chairman, dito sa proposed National Road System,

asr-000911
01:10:33.080 --> 01:10:35.159
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: mayroong 199.58 billion.

asr-000912
01:10:35.159 --> 01:10:43.310
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kasama ba dito ang pag-four lanes ng Maharlika Highway?

asr-000913
01:10:43.320 --> 01:10:47.100
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kasi napakaganda na yung ginawa ninyo sa Maharlika Highway.

asr-000914
01:10:47.200 --> 01:10:49.220
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Sana tuloy-tuloy na po. Pero may mga two lanes pa rin.

asr-000915
01:10:49.380 --> 01:10:52.700
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Sana matuloy po natin maging four lanes.

asr-000916
01:10:52.860 --> 01:10:55.120
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Lalo na yung Samar area, maganda na.

asr-000917
01:10:55.440 --> 01:10:58.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you po, Mr. Chairman, Minority Leader.

asr-000918
01:11:00.460 --> 01:11:04.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron pong mga segments na may widening tayo.

asr-000919
01:11:04.140 --> 01:11:09.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero I have to admit po, ako po mismo ang nagsabi na

asr-000920
01:11:10.880 --> 01:11:14.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: i-minimize natin yung widening. And I will respond po.

asr-000921
01:11:15.640 --> 01:11:17.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi po, sabi ko po sa mga regions po,

asr-000922
01:11:17.560 --> 01:11:23.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa mga regions natin, kung pwede, unahin po muna namin,

asr-000923
01:11:24.120 --> 01:11:27.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: bago mag-widen, ayusin po na natin yung mga sira-sira.

asr-000924
01:11:27.940 --> 01:11:32.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi unfortunately po, lalo na po sa areas ng Bicol,

asr-000925
01:11:32.520 --> 01:11:36.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: some areas ng Central Luzon, some areas ng Region 4A,

asr-000926
01:11:36.720 --> 01:11:41.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: lalo na po sa Quezon, some areas ng Northern Samar at Samar,

asr-000927
01:11:41.280 --> 01:11:45.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: marami pong talagang sira-sira.

asr-000928
01:11:45.820 --> 01:11:48.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At yun po talaga ang pinaprioritize natin.

asr-000929
01:11:49.280 --> 01:11:51.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In Mindanao, it's the same.

asr-000930
01:11:51.320 --> 01:11:57.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero po, pag ayos na naman po yun, then okay na pong mag-widen.

asr-000931
01:11:58.160 --> 01:12:04.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero ang kailangan nga talaga sa widening, masigurado po na merong right of way.

asr-000932
01:12:04.720 --> 01:12:07.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi minsan po, ang napansin din po namin,

asr-000933
01:12:08.200 --> 01:12:14.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: nag-a-allocate po ng pondo for widening ng Mahalika, pero wala namang right of way.

asr-000934
01:12:14.180 --> 01:12:18.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So ang nangyayari po, nawawiden, isang kilometro, biglang napuputol.

asr-000935
01:12:18.460 --> 01:12:25.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So while important po talaga yung widening, Mr. Chairman, Minority Leader,

asr-000936
01:12:25.040 --> 01:12:28.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: we are trying to rationalize it in that way po.

asr-000937
01:12:28.220 --> 01:12:32.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But rest assured po, yung Northern Samar to Samar, because these are the most,

asr-000938
01:12:32.800 --> 01:12:40.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: one of the most dilapidated sections, priority po talaga natin yan, Mr. Chairman, Mr. Minority Leader.

asr-000939
01:12:41.200 --> 01:12:42.440
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000940
01:12:42.780 --> 01:12:47.400
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Pangalawa po, Mr. Chairman, ito pong isang napaka-importanting project natin

asr-000941
01:12:47.400 --> 01:13:02.160
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na lagyan natin ng pondo ng 2026 yung for the feasibility study of the Sorsogon-Samar bridge link.

asr-000942
01:13:02.960 --> 01:13:09.280
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Pwede bang ma-update kami dito kung ano na yung napaka-vital na connector bridge na ito?

asr-000943
01:13:09.280 --> 01:13:15.360
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Sa Luzon, Samar, Visayas, at Mindanao, napakahalaga po ito sa ating ekonomiya.

asr-000944
01:13:15.360 --> 01:13:27.260
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At kung maaari po, mabrief ninyo kami ng status report kung ano na ang sitwasyon dito sa gagawin nating tulay.

asr-000945
01:13:29.260 --> 01:13:32.500
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chairman, Minority Leader.

asr-000946
01:13:32.500 --> 01:13:39.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Napaka-importante po ng Matnog-Allen Bridge, or ngayon is the Sorsogon-Northern Samar Bridge.

asr-000947
01:13:40.480 --> 01:13:46.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: This is a critical link part of the Maharlika network connecting Luzon to the Visayas.

asr-000948
01:13:48.600 --> 01:13:53.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: This is very close to my heart, and I know very close to the heart of the Minority Leader, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000949
01:13:53.640 --> 01:14:00.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi nung ako po ay flagship sekretary po ng previous administration, priority po ito.

asr-000950
01:14:00.040 --> 01:14:06.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unfortunately, during that time, it was thought to be unimplementable

asr-000951
01:14:06.440 --> 01:14:09.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: because of the depth of the channel in between.

asr-000952
01:14:09.880 --> 01:14:12.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sorsogon and Northern Samar.

asr-000953
01:14:12.160 --> 01:14:19.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero I am happy po to report today, as promised po to the Minority Leader last time,

asr-000954
01:14:19.280 --> 01:14:24.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na we will allocate the much needed feasibility study for this,

asr-000955
01:14:24.220 --> 01:14:29.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and we have 120 million pesos allocated for this in the 2027 NEP.

asr-000956
01:14:29.940 --> 01:14:36.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And if I may be allowed, Mr. Chairman, to just present to the committee and to the Honorable Minority Leader,

asr-000957
01:14:36.560 --> 01:14:38.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: meron na pong solusyon.

asr-000958
01:14:40.240 --> 01:14:45.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, dati po yung original plan, and I'm sure the Minority Leader is very familiar,

asr-000959
01:14:46.440 --> 01:14:53.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Diretso po tayo matnog to Allen via the open sea, via the channel.

asr-000960
01:14:53.900 --> 01:14:55.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: This was...

asr-000961
01:14:55.120 --> 01:15:00.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: deemed to be unimplementable because of the depth of that channel.

asr-000962
01:15:00.220 --> 01:15:08.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ngayon po, yung designer po, ito po yung designer mismo ng Bataan Cavite Link Bridge,

asr-000963
01:15:09.220 --> 01:15:10.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: T.Y. Lin of the United States.

asr-000964
01:15:10.780 --> 01:15:15.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: They're the ones that have built all these iconic bridges all over the country,

asr-000965
01:15:15.840 --> 01:15:21.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: including the Bay Bridge in San Francisco, many bridges in the Middle East, in Europe.

asr-000966
01:15:22.680 --> 01:15:24.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sila po ang nag-design ng Bataan-Cavite Link Bridge.

asr-000967
01:15:25.980 --> 01:15:27.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sila po ang nakahanap ng solusyon.

asr-000968
01:15:27.660 --> 01:15:32.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: This is one of the biggest design companies for bridges in the world.

asr-000969
01:15:33.280 --> 01:15:39.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: They designed it in a way where it will connect to, sorry,

asr-000970
01:15:42.800 --> 01:15:47.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ay sorry po, 130 million po pala ngayong GAA itong feasibility studies.

asr-000971
01:15:47.460 --> 01:15:49.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ngayong 2026, hindi po 2027.

asr-000972
01:15:49.980 --> 01:15:54.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 130 million for 2026 po pala ito.

asr-000973
01:15:54.460 --> 01:15:55.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nagsisimula na po ito.

asr-000974
01:15:55.660 --> 01:15:58.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And kasama na po itong study na ito.

asr-000975
01:15:58.520 --> 01:16:02.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dadaan po tayo sa Capul Island.

asr-000976
01:16:02.760 --> 01:16:04.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tama po ba, Mr. Chairman?

asr-000977
01:16:04.500 --> 01:16:07.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I think this is also a major tourist destination.

asr-000978
01:16:08.980 --> 01:16:13.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At susunod po sa, anong island yan? Sorry.

asr-000979
01:16:15.240 --> 01:16:16.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dinalupihan Island.

asr-000980
01:16:16.540 --> 01:16:20.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And then papasok na po sa Northern Samar.

asr-000981
01:16:21.500 --> 01:16:24.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So this not only addresses the engineering challenge,

asr-000982
01:16:24.800 --> 01:16:28.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na dadaan sa malalim na tubig,

asr-000983
01:16:28.620 --> 01:16:31.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: it actually also makes it cheaper.

asr-000984
01:16:31.940 --> 01:16:34.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mas magiging mura po itong tulay na ito

asr-000985
01:16:34.160 --> 01:16:37.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dahil po dadaan na tayo dito sa dalawang isla na ito.

asr-000986
01:16:37.240 --> 01:16:40.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Similar po dun sa ginawa nilang design sa Bataan Cavite

asr-000987
01:16:40.420 --> 01:16:42.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na dumadaan sa Corregidor.

asr-000988
01:16:43.100 --> 01:16:46.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: May dadaan ng isang isla sa gitna yung Corridor Island.

asr-000989
01:16:46.680 --> 01:16:50.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So I'm happy to report po na nagkakalinaw na po tayo

asr-000990
01:16:50.080 --> 01:16:53.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dito sa ating Sorsogon Samar Link Bridge.

asr-000991
01:16:55.920 --> 01:16:57.720
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Magandang balita yan, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000992
01:16:57.860 --> 01:17:00.940
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mukhang malapit na tayo mapunta ng Surigao dito

asr-000993
01:17:00.940 --> 01:17:02.560
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: at saka kaya sa Cagayan de Oro.

asr-000994
01:17:02.620 --> 01:17:05.880
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kaya masayang-masaya ang pinsan ko si Kong Rufus.

asr-000995
01:17:07.240 --> 01:17:08.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, ilang-ilang...

asr-000996
01:17:09.300 --> 01:17:11.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sorry po, Minority.

asr-000997
01:17:11.940 --> 01:17:14.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Speaking of that po, Honorable Chairman,

asr-000998
01:17:15.000 --> 01:17:18.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ine-next na po natin yung Southern Leyte to Surigao.

asr-000999
01:17:20.260 --> 01:17:24.920
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Chairman, may budget ngayon sa NIP natin na

asr-001000
01:17:25.580 --> 01:17:33.400
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: P350 million for feasibility study for Mindanao-Leyte Bridge Link.

asr-001001
01:17:34.100 --> 01:17:38.100
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: So napakaganda nitong dalawang proyekto.

asr-001002
01:17:38.160 --> 01:17:41.840
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Anyway, ilang kilometro po ba ang nangyayari

asr-001003
01:17:41.840 --> 01:17:45.720
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: pag ginawa natin itong Dinalupihan, yung Allen

asr-001004
01:17:45.740 --> 01:17:50.960
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Dinalupihan, Capul, Matnog, or Sorsogon Bridge?

asr-001005
01:17:51.140 --> 01:17:52.280
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Nagiging ilang kilometro?

asr-001006
01:17:52.360 --> 01:17:53.120
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Together with the...

asr-001007
01:17:53.120 --> 01:17:55.160
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Yung nasa isla...

asr-001008
01:17:55.160 --> 01:17:58.200
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Yung nasa isla po na dadaan sa dalawang isla.

asr-001009
01:17:58.220 --> 01:18:00.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: It is roughly about 20 kilometers.

asr-001010
01:18:00.680 --> 01:18:01.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: It will be the...

asr-001011
01:18:02.720 --> 01:18:04.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Once it is done,

asr-001012
01:18:04.520 --> 01:18:08.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and once the Bataan-Cavite Link Bridge is done,

asr-001013
01:18:09.080 --> 01:18:11.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: it will be the second longest bridge in the country.

asr-001014
01:18:11.820 --> 01:18:14.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Second to Bataan-Cavite Link Bridge.

asr-001015
01:18:14.520 --> 01:18:17.080
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: So, Mr. Chairman, mas maiksi pala ito

asr-001016
01:18:17.080 --> 01:18:20.320
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: kaysa Bataan-Cavite Bridge.

asr-001017
01:18:20.720 --> 01:18:21.480
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mas maiksi ito.

asr-001018
01:18:21.500 --> 01:18:22.760
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: 20 kilometers lang ito.

asr-001019
01:18:23.420 --> 01:18:25.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ang pangatlong tanong, Mr. Chairman,

asr-001020
01:18:26.120 --> 01:18:28.240
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: sa economic rate of return,

asr-001021
01:18:28.900 --> 01:18:31.760
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: itong napaka-importante pag mag-de-decide tayo

asr-001022
01:18:31.760 --> 01:18:33.620
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ng ganitong mega-structures,

asr-001023
01:18:34.060 --> 01:18:37.020
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ano ang mas malaking economic rate of return?

asr-001024
01:18:37.280 --> 01:18:42.600
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Yung Cavite-Bataan Bridge or yung Sorsogon-Samar Bridge Link?

asr-001025
01:18:43.000 --> 01:18:46.160
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Chairman, maganda po yung...

asr-001026
01:18:46.160 --> 01:18:47.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Napakaganda po yung tanong.

asr-001027
01:18:47.440 --> 01:18:50.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Again po, Maharlika network po ito

asr-001028
01:18:50.640 --> 01:18:55.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kasi Sorsogon ay Bicol to Northern Samar.

asr-001029
01:18:56.100 --> 01:18:58.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mataas po ang Cavite-Bataan Link Bridge.

asr-001030
01:18:59.080 --> 01:19:02.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 33% po ang economic rate of return.

asr-001031
01:19:02.580 --> 01:19:06.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero po ang Bicol to Samar Link Bridge

asr-001032
01:19:06.040 --> 01:19:08.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ay 42% economic rate of return.

asr-001033
01:19:08.860 --> 01:19:15.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mas mataas pa po ang Sorsogon to Northern Samar Link Bridge

asr-001034
01:19:15.780 --> 01:19:16.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: economic rate of return.

asr-001035
01:19:16.800 --> 01:19:18.600
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: I think ito po ang isa sa mga pinakamataas

asr-001036
01:19:18.600 --> 01:19:20.860
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na economic rate of return na bridges.

asr-001037
01:19:21.060 --> 01:19:24.440
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Secretary, baka hindi naisama ang tourism aspect.

asr-001038
01:19:24.440 --> 01:19:28.180
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: In your evaluation, please check on that.

asr-001039
01:19:28.840 --> 01:19:30.240
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Para madagdag doon sa IRR.

asr-001040
01:19:32.020 --> 01:19:34.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We will do that, Mr. Chairman. Thank you.

asr-001041
01:19:34.940 --> 01:19:36.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero mataas po talaga.

asr-001042
01:19:37.100 --> 01:19:41.300
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Chairman, kaya apat na taon po ako nag-iingay dito

asr-001043
01:19:41.300 --> 01:19:44.540
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: dahil pag gusto natin gumadang ating bansa,

asr-001044
01:19:44.620 --> 01:19:47.480
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: tumbukin natin yung mga tamang problema ng ating bansa.

asr-001045
01:19:47.680 --> 01:19:52.260
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Masaya ko nandyan ang ating Secretary of Public Works and Highways

asr-001046
01:19:52.260 --> 01:19:54.420
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na napakasipag at nakikita niya ito.

asr-001047
01:19:54.880 --> 01:19:56.880
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ang susunod na tanong, Mr. Chairman,

asr-001048
01:19:57.160 --> 01:19:58.800
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ang timeline natin.

asr-001049
01:19:58.840 --> 01:20:02.400
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kasi kung makaari magawa ito sa panahon ni Presidente Bongbong Marcos,

asr-001050
01:20:02.520 --> 01:20:04.880
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: napaka-importante po na tulay na ito.

asr-001051
01:20:04.980 --> 01:20:06.800
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ano po ba ang timeline?

asr-001052
01:20:09.340 --> 01:20:12.400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unfortunately po, mukhang hindi natin magagawa ito

asr-001053
01:20:12.400 --> 01:20:15.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: within the next two years or one year.

asr-001054
01:20:15.540 --> 01:20:19.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: A little less than two years na today.

asr-001055
01:20:20.860 --> 01:20:23.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero po, ito po ang tingin kong makukomit natin.

asr-001056
01:20:24.000 --> 01:20:24.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Na pagkatapos,

asr-001057
01:20:24.600 --> 01:20:28.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pagkatapos po kasi ng feasibility study na ginagawa ito.

asr-001058
01:20:28.440 --> 01:20:29.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang next step po,

asr-001059
01:20:29.460 --> 01:20:34.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang feasibility study po siguro matatapos na by next year,

asr-001060
01:20:34.840 --> 01:20:37.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 2027 po, matatapos na natin yung FS.

asr-001061
01:20:37.660 --> 01:20:41.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang next step po natin dito ay makahanap po ng funding source.

asr-001062
01:20:42.160 --> 01:20:47.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil hindi po biro ang... at wala po po akong magbibigay na estimated cost dito.

asr-001063
01:20:47.920 --> 01:20:49.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero tingin ko po,

asr-001064
01:20:49.180 --> 01:20:52.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at nakausap na po namin ang malalaking funding agencies,

asr-001065
01:20:52.760 --> 01:20:53.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang ADB,

asr-001066
01:20:53.600 --> 01:20:55.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang Korea,

asr-001067
01:20:55.480 --> 01:20:56.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang JICA,

asr-001068
01:20:56.860 --> 01:20:59.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang AIIB,

asr-001069
01:20:59.340 --> 01:21:01.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kamukha po nung Bataan Cavite,

asr-001070
01:21:01.280 --> 01:21:04.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: which is jointly financed by ADB and AIIB.

asr-001071
01:21:04.740 --> 01:21:10.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: They have expressed very, very strong interest to funding this.

asr-001072
01:21:10.760 --> 01:21:16.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Simply because of the very, very high economic rate of return.

asr-001073
01:21:16.220 --> 01:21:18.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Na higher pa po than Bataan Cavite.

asr-001074
01:21:18.800 --> 01:21:21.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tingin ko po, hindi po tayo magkakaproblemang makahanap ng funding.

asr-001075
01:21:21.900 --> 01:21:25.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And if we can get funding and we can get final approval,

asr-001076
01:21:25.460 --> 01:21:32.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: approval of the DepDev board or the Economic Development Council before the end of the term,

asr-001077
01:21:33.260 --> 01:21:38.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: maglaking bagay na po ito at ipapasa na natin po yung construction nito sa susunod na administration.

asr-001078
01:21:38.700 --> 01:21:42.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I think the timeline for construction is six years po.

asr-001079
01:21:43.220 --> 01:21:45.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang timeline for construction is six years.

asr-001080
01:21:46.400 --> 01:21:51.920
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Anyway, Mr. Chairman, may gestation period dito pagkawa ng feasibility study.

asr-001081
01:21:52.640 --> 01:21:55.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi naman natin pwedeng madaliin ito.

asr-001082
01:21:55.080 --> 01:21:59.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero wars are won based on plans, according to Sun Tzu, diba?

asr-001083
01:21:59.340 --> 01:22:03.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pag maganda ang plano natin, may funding source na, tapos na yan.

asr-001084
01:22:04.140 --> 01:22:04.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Diba?

asr-001085
01:22:04.660 --> 01:22:06.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi implementation na lang ang susunod.

asr-001086
01:22:06.940 --> 01:22:15.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya, Mr. Chairman, patuloy lang tayo na suportahan ang magandang mga proyekto na makakaganda sa ating bansa.

asr-001087
01:22:15.600 --> 01:22:21.440
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At congratulations, Sir Vince, sa inyong masusing pag-aaral nito.

asr-001088
01:22:21.880 --> 01:22:24.440
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At asahan nyo po ang aming suporta.

asr-001089
01:22:24.440 --> 01:22:28.420
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Para matuluyang magawa ng ang proyekto nito.

asr-001090
01:22:28.700 --> 01:22:34.160
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Maraming salamat, Secretary Vince Dizon, at saka maraming salamat, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001091
01:22:36.060 --> 01:22:39.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Congratulations, Minority Leader.

asr-001092
01:22:39.660 --> 01:22:42.440
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Talagang tutuloy na yung program mo, project mo.

asr-001093
01:22:42.640 --> 01:22:43.720
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Tutuloy na natin yan.

asr-001094
01:22:44.060 --> 01:22:46.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Well, thank you so much, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001095
01:22:46.480 --> 01:22:49.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: if I just may add one sentence na lang po.

asr-001096
01:22:49.180 --> 01:22:49.660
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Ah, yes, yes.

asr-001097
01:22:50.100 --> 01:22:55.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dati po yung Bataan Cavite, kaya po panaginip lang po yun.

asr-001098
01:22:55.060 --> 01:23:01.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero I'm happy to report po na the two approaches are already ongoing construction.

asr-001099
01:23:01.760 --> 01:23:10.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And we will be awarding the major span of the Bataan Cavite Link Bridge within the month of September.

asr-001100
01:23:10.720 --> 01:23:14.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ito po yung sa gitna ng Manila Bay na critical path po, yung P6

asr-001101
01:23:15.960 --> 01:23:19.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And we will be awarding that very soon po in September.

asr-001102
01:23:19.540 --> 01:23:21.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, hindi na po panaginip. Totoo na po yun.

asr-001103
01:23:21.720 --> 01:23:23.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And tingin ko po, yun din po ang mangyayari

asr-001104
01:23:23.280 --> 01:23:25.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa

asr-001106
01:23:25.520 --> 01:23:27.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sorsogon to Samar Bridge.

asr-001107
01:23:27.380 --> 01:23:27.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you po.

asr-001108
01:23:27.940 --> 01:23:32.120
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Mr. Secretary, for your information.

asr-001109
01:23:32.940 --> 01:23:33.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next to...

asr-001110
01:23:33.920 --> 01:23:35.740
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next to...

asr-001111
01:23:37.440 --> 01:23:38.380
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Interpellate, Honorable Toby Tiangco.

asr-001112
01:23:40.800 --> 01:23:42.200
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: From the Independent.

asr-001113
01:23:45.520 --> 01:23:46.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-001114
01:23:46.900 --> 01:23:47.880
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Thank you.

asr-001115
01:23:47.940 --> 01:23:52.360
