01:36:15.800 --> 01:36:18.080
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Kasi minsan, malaking bagay ito sa transparency.

asr-001703
01:36:18.180 --> 01:36:21.860
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Kasi minsan, nabawa may project na i-turnover, nagreklamo yung recipient.

asr-001716
01:36:21.860 --> 01:36:27.060
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: sa sabihin, tatanong ko, bakit hindi nyo ito nireklamo habang ongoing yung project?

asr-001728
01:36:27.300 --> 01:36:30.720
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Ang sasabihin nila lagi is, ayaw namang ipakita sa amin yung plano,

asr-001740
01:36:30.740 --> 01:36:34.900
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: ayaw namang explain sa amin yung plano, paano namin mag-check kung ginagawa yung kailangan gawin.

asr-001750
01:36:35.300 --> 01:36:37.860
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: So, pwede po bang sanang ganun?

asr-001761
01:36:40.000 --> 01:36:44.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo, actually yun po ang utos namin sa mga regional directors at sa mga district engineers

asr-001773
01:36:44.840 --> 01:36:47.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na talaga pong makipag-coordinate sa locals.

asr-001787
01:36:47.560 --> 01:36:52.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi, sige naman po talaga, alam nyo naman po kung gano'ng kalaki ang departamento nito.

asr-001804
01:36:52.900 --> 01:37:00.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: It's a department with 75,000 employees, so many district offices, so many regional offices.

asr-001820
01:37:00.740 --> 01:37:06.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And we really need the district offices and the regional offices to really be on the ground

asr-001832
01:37:06.180 --> 01:37:08.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and really talking to the communities

asr-001840
01:37:08.640 --> 01:37:10.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and make sure kung ano po talaga ang mga pinakakailangan.

asr-001849
01:37:11.140 --> 01:37:14.300
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: So we agree po 100%, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001860
01:37:14.860 --> 01:37:17.100
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Mr. Chair, gusto ko lang i-highlight yung role

asr-001868
01:37:17.100 --> 01:37:19.700
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: ng mga project engineers sa implementation ng projects.

asr-001876
01:37:19.960 --> 01:37:21.980
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: I'd like to complain about project engineers

asr-001886
01:37:21.980 --> 01:37:26.280
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: who are not present during yung mga structural na mga ginagawa.

asr-001894
01:37:26.500 --> 01:37:29.040
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Tapos pangalawa, recently last month,

asr-001899
01:37:29.080 --> 01:37:30.300
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: may nakausap akong project engineer

asr-001906
01:37:30.300 --> 01:37:33.900
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: kasi nireklamo ko yung tribal hall sa Gutalac.

asr-001912
01:37:33.900 --> 01:37:36.260
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Bakit depressed yung isa sa heg?

asr-001918
01:37:36.560 --> 01:37:39.200
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Sabi ko, anong nakikita mong problema dito?

asr-001924
01:37:39.300 --> 01:37:44.980
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Ang opening niya is, wala naman po siguro problema Sabi ko, teka muna, may problema

asr-001931
01:37:44.980 --> 01:37:49.900
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: I mean, lagi nagiging habit natin is maghanap ng explanation, excuse

asr-001938
01:37:50.460 --> 01:37:52.920
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Para sa projects na hindi naman maayos

asr-001948
01:37:52.920 --> 01:37:57.720
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Sabi ko, alam mo, DE, PE, pag ganyan tayo, mag-aaway talaga tayo

asr-001959
01:37:57.720 --> 01:38:00.520
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Kasi unang-una, mahirap maghanap ng pondo para sa mga projects

asr-001966
01:38:00.520 --> 01:38:02.120
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Tapos, bakit ganun?

asr-001977
01:38:02.120 --> 01:38:10.240
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Tapos sa pangalawa po, meron kaming super health center sa Gutalac pa rin na sobrang tagal, two years or three years ginawa nung ano.

asr-001992
01:38:10.340 --> 01:38:20.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya nakikiusap ako ipa-blacklist yung nanalo sa bid noon. Kaya lang minsan ang hirap mag-request eh kasi minsan mga kapit yung mga contractor eh.

asr-001999
01:38:20.940 --> 01:38:25.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I couldn't agree more sa observation ni Congressman Amatombo.

asr-002021
01:38:25.300 --> 01:38:34.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I mean, ang dami ko na hong napagalitan at namurang mga project engineers sa aking limited na pag-iikot habang nandito po sa DPWH.

asr-002034
01:38:34.280 --> 01:38:35.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At tama po kayo.

asr-002041
01:38:36.140 --> 01:38:38.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Talagang meron pong mga iba, hindi naman lahat.

asr-002050
01:38:38.820 --> 01:38:40.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: May mga maayos din naman po.

asr-002058
01:38:40.660 --> 01:38:44.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero meron pong iba talaga na unfortunately ganyan po.

asr-002068
01:38:44.220 --> 01:38:49.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya talagang ang aming reforma hindi nga po humihingi to sa district level.

asr-002078
01:38:49.660 --> 01:38:52.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kailangan po pati sa project engineer level, kailangan.

asr-002097
01:38:52.140 --> 01:39:07.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kung may mga hindi nagpo-perform, kailangan po talaga ang pagitan at tanggalin. At pagitan natin ang mga mas nagpo-perform. But if I may lang po, Mr. Chairman, and I think this is a very important policy and at the same time, implementation concern.

asr-002112
01:39:09.500 --> 01:39:13.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: If you will give me just one second to get some data, Mr. Chairman.

asr-002113
01:39:16.020 --> 01:39:29.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And Chairman Romipo will know this very well. How much? Okay. Under current rules po ng DPWH,

asr-002114
01:39:30.240 --> 01:39:33.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: para po maging epektibo ang isang project engineer,

asr-002115
01:39:34.060 --> 01:39:38.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dapat 1 is to 7 lang ang kanyang,

asr-002116
01:39:39.400 --> 01:39:44.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: meaning 1 project engineer to 7 projects. Maximum.

asr-002117
01:39:45.100 --> 01:39:53.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang problema po natin, sa dami nga po ng mga proyekto na dinatnan natin at nagkapatong-patong na throughout the years,

asr-002118
01:39:54.240 --> 01:40:03.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: umaabot to minsan ng 1 is to 30. 30 or sometimes even more.

asr-002120
01:40:05.600 --> 01:40:08.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So kaya nga po tagagang when we were preparing this budget,

asr-002127
01:40:08.940 --> 01:40:15.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: tagagang pong pinigit namin na pwede ba babaan na muna natin yung number of these projects

asr-002147
01:40:15.060 --> 01:40:23.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi hirap din naman po kami makahingi ng dagdag na items sa DBM for more project engineers.

asr-002162
01:40:23.460 --> 01:40:30.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So it really becomes a structural problem sa DPWH kung ang isang project engineer,

asr-002175
01:40:31.120 --> 01:40:34.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 30 project ang minomonitor at sinusupervise.

asr-002180
01:40:34.780 --> 01:40:39.400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Talaga pong tingin ko magkakaproblema po tayo dyan kung ganyang karami.

asr-002183
01:40:39.400 --> 01:40:48.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya we will ask the help din po of the committee. Baka po pwedeng padagdagan din po kami ng mga items for project engineers sa DBM.

asr-002184
01:40:49.220 --> 01:40:55.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Lago na po ngayon, ang dami pong interesado ngayon ng mga young engineers na gustong magtrabaho sa gobyerno.

asr-002185
01:40:55.300 --> 01:41:02.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi po talaga ngayon, umaabot minsan ng 1 is to 30. Whereas the ideal is only 1 is to 7 or 1 is to 10.

asr-002186
01:41:03.980 --> 01:41:07.960
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: I agree with you, Secretary Pero siguro kung yung project nyo yung nag-uumpisa

asr-002187
01:41:07.960 --> 01:41:11.780
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: sa walang problema dun sa depressed. Hindi siguro workload yung problema

asr-002188
01:41:11.780 --> 01:41:18.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi po, I'm not making excuses for that particular project engineer In fact, maybe you can tell me who this project

asr-002189
01:41:18.220 --> 01:41:22.240
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: engineer is, patanggal na ho natin at pagitan na ho natin, nang mas magagay

asr-002190
01:41:23.220 --> 01:41:28.160
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Secretary, gusto ko lang sanang mag-appel ko yung nabanggit nyo kasi kanina, ang project

asr-002191
01:41:28.160 --> 01:41:30.080
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: ay dapat may basihan

asr-002192
01:41:30.080 --> 01:41:34.920
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Kanina, nabanggit nyo rin na na tinanggal nyo na doon sa convergence with other agencies.

asr-002193
01:41:35.180 --> 01:41:41.520
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Ako, I'd like to appeal yun sa pagtanggal nyo sa convergence ng DOH. Kasi, in my district, meron akong hospital

asr-002194
01:41:41.520 --> 01:41:49.480
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: that entails almost a billion, siguro mga 600, 700 million yung kailangan. This year po, nagbigay kayo ng 150,

asr-002195
01:41:49.800 --> 01:41:55.600
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: di pa na-implement eh, kasi natagalan tayo eh. Tapos, ang problema ko, we cannot wait for 4

asr-002196
01:41:55.600 --> 01:41:57.580
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: or 5 years before makompleto yung

asr-002197
01:41:57.580 --> 01:41:59.520
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: hospital, kasi kailangan-kailangan ng tao.

asr-002198
01:41:59.760 --> 01:42:05.480
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: We are a poverty district and district, we need the hospital. I'd like to appeal na sana

asr-002199
01:42:05.480 --> 01:42:11.420
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: mapunduhan. Kasi last year pa lang, nag-umpisa na ako, nag-request na ako sa district, nag-request na ako sa region na sana mapunduhan. Sabi nila,

asr-002200
01:42:11.460 --> 01:42:15.320
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: okay. Suddenly ngayon, pagdatingin ko sa budget, wala. Yung DOH po,

asr-002201
01:42:15.360 --> 01:42:20.700
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: naglagay sila. Kaya lang, may cap din siyempre sila kasi hindi man pwedeng i-prioritize nila isang hospital over lahat ng hospital.

asr-002202
01:42:21.680 --> 01:42:29.280
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Kaya lang, under kasi ng DPWH, ang public works. And I do believe, ang hospital falls under public works

asr-002203
01:42:29.280 --> 01:42:31.860
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: na necessary para sa mga tao. Pwede po ba?

asr-002203-split1
01:42:34.600 --> 01:42:39.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, if I may respond lang to that. Okay. Mayroong po,

asr-002204
01:42:39.780 --> 01:42:46.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: majority po kasi of the hospitals, for example, especially the bigger hospitals, the regional hospitals,

asr-002205
01:42:47.020 --> 01:42:54.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: eh talaga pong DOH budget yan. Para pong DepEd yan. Dati po, binago na po ata. Dati po kasi

asr-002206
01:42:54.500 --> 01:42:59.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: talaga nakalad siya DPWH, pero binago na po ata. I don't know when.

asr-002207
01:42:59.780 --> 01:43:12.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Several years ago, linaj na po sa DOH budget ang hospitals. Pero meron pong mga manglilang na mga magigit na HFEP na nakapasok po sa DPWH.

asr-002208
01:43:13.140 --> 01:43:19.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unfortunately po, ngayong pong year na ito, sinabi po ng DBM, tanggalin na

asr-002209
01:43:20.920 --> 01:43:26.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at ilagay na lang sa DOH. Yun po ang ano. But, ako po,

asr-002210
01:43:26.700 --> 01:43:30.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I can understand po the concern of Congressman Amatong.

asr-002212
01:43:30.980 --> 01:43:35.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Baka naman po pwedeng i-appeal natin, wisdom naman po ng Kongreso ito,

asr-002213
01:43:35.920 --> 01:43:38.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: baka po pwedeng i-appeal natin at least yung mga ongoing.

asr-002214
01:43:39.420 --> 01:43:47.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pwede pong ibarek at ipondohan ulit except yung new. Huwag na yung new, yung ongoing na rin

asr-002215
01:43:47.140 --> 01:43:52.040
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: para masigurado lang na mapondohan. Technically, ongoing po ito kasi napondohan doon sa 2026.

asr-002216
01:43:52.320 --> 01:43:56.140
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Although, sabi nyo nga, antagal nag-umpisa. I'd like to ask, Mr. Chair,

asr-002217
01:43:56.260 --> 01:43:59.540
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: ano ba mas importante? Ang widening ng kalsada o yung hospital?

asr-002218
01:43:59.900 --> 01:44:07.340
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Ang asphalting o ang hospital? Hindi naman dyan pwede na we create a policy for creating a policy yun lang.

asr-002221
01:44:07.340 --> 01:44:26.820
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: We should always keep in mind that our priority, yung needs ng tao, I will say this vehemently, we need a hospital to be finished, not 5 years, but 1 year na pong lumipas eh, 2025 pa to naipasa eh, ngayon 2026 walang nangyari, walang nangyari, 2027 hindi natin lalagyan.

asr-002223
01:44:28.880 --> 01:44:33.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Again, I could not agree more po with Congressman Amatong. If we can po

asr-002224
01:44:33.020 --> 01:44:36.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: maybe ask DBM to have an exemption to this

asr-002225
01:44:37.840 --> 01:44:44.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: policy, especially for continuing projects, DPWH po is more than willing po.

asr-002226
01:44:45.240 --> 01:44:48.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you po. Unfortunately, it's out of my

asr-002227
01:44:49.540 --> 01:44:53.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: department's hands for right now, Mr. Chairman, unfortunately. But I agree

asr-002228
01:44:53.080 --> 01:44:53.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: po 100%.

asr-002229
01:44:53.860 --> 01:44:58.560
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: I have to say it kasi kailangan on record eh, para malaman.

asr-002230
01:44:59.460 --> 01:45:04.760
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Our constituents are asking, sana naman, antagal na namin nakalimutan eh, dun sa Mindanao

asr-002231
01:45:04.760 --> 01:45:08.720
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Road Network, kami yung pinakahuli na yung highway na kumpleto, missing link kami

asr-002232
01:45:08.720 --> 01:45:10.640
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: for the longest time. Ayun, pati ba naman

asr-002233
01:45:10.640 --> 01:45:12.540
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: ng ilang public works na kailangan-kailangan namin,

asr-002234
01:45:12.580 --> 01:45:13.820
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: hindi pa ibibigay sa amin?

asr-002235
01:45:15.260 --> 01:45:21.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo, Mr. Chairman. I hope po maybe the Committee on Appropriations po, can convince

asr-002236
01:45:21.000 --> 01:45:24.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: the DBM to allow this amendment to the

asr-002237
01:45:24.840 --> 01:45:26.680
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: net. Thank you very much.

asr-002238
01:45:26.700 --> 01:45:28.620
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Thank you very much po. Ano ko lang din po,

asr-002239
01:45:28.640 --> 01:45:30.140
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: reklamo ko as a matter of policy.

asr-002240
01:45:30.400 --> 01:45:32.640
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Halimbawa kasi sa amin, yung Lingayon Bridge sa

asr-002241
01:45:32.640 --> 01:45:35.760
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Cebu ko, ginawa siya, walang approach.

asr-002242
01:45:36.420 --> 01:45:42.220
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: For two years, request ng request yung DPWH sa show ko ng budget for the approach,

asr-002243
01:45:42.360 --> 01:45:44.520
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: hindi nalagyan. Finally, sa third year,

asr-002244
01:45:44.580 --> 01:45:46.800
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: ngayon nalagyan niya. Hindi po ba pwedeng

asr-002245
01:45:46.800 --> 01:45:48.680
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: as a matter of policy, yung

asr-002246
01:45:48.680 --> 01:45:52.440
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: mga ganong unfinished, e-allocate na natin kagad, kesa naman sa nag-uupin.

asr-002248
01:45:52.440 --> 01:45:56.100
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Again, mas importante siyempre yung approach ng tulay kesa sa widening.

asr-002250
01:45:56.180 --> 01:45:59.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mas importante yung approach ng tulay kesa sa asphalting, di ba po?

asr-002251
01:46:00.680 --> 01:46:05.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Again, I could not agree more with the Honorable Congressman from Zamboanga del Norte.

asr-002252
01:46:05.720 --> 01:46:09.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi po, yan po yung talagang pinipilit naming gawin ngayon.

asr-002253
01:46:11.420 --> 01:46:12.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Prioritize the unfinished.

asr-002254
01:46:13.300 --> 01:46:17.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And like I said po earlier, kailangan po i-MYCA na ang mga ongoing.

asr-002255
01:46:17.620 --> 01:46:23.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: going. Para po wala nang risk na mawawalan sa mga future years. Para

asr-002256
01:46:23.320 --> 01:46:24.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: tuloy-tuloy po at matapos po agad.

asr-002257
01:46:25.220 --> 01:46:29.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We will strive to do that po, Mr. Chairman. At napansin nga po ni

asr-002258
01:46:29.760 --> 01:46:35.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: the Honorable Congresswoman from Zamboanga del Norte na napondohan na po natin ngayon.

asr-002259
01:46:35.320 --> 01:46:37.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And I want to ensure na mapondohan po yan tuloy-tuloy.

asr-002260
01:46:37.680 --> 01:46:43.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: As for the widening, again po, like yung sinabi ko po kay minority leader kanina, mas priority po namin

asr-002261
01:46:43.620 --> 01:46:47.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kaysa widening yung matapos at makonect muna. Kasi bagay wala po

asr-002262
01:46:47.320 --> 01:46:48.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: po ang widening kung hindi tapos ang kalye.

asr-002263
01:46:48.920 --> 01:46:50.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi hindi naman po madadaan yun.

asr-002264
01:46:50.520 --> 01:46:54.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kahit madadaanan yun, kahit six lanes pa yun, kung hindi hanggang dulo

asr-002265
01:46:54.720 --> 01:46:55.640
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: hindi din magagamit yun.

asr-002266
01:46:55.880 --> 01:46:57.240
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: We agree po 100%.

asr-002267
01:46:58.700 --> 01:47:00.400
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Marami po akong messages na tanggap ngayon.

asr-002268
01:47:00.400 --> 01:47:02.600
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Itanong ko raw yun sa Quezon Bridge ng Dipolog City

asr-002269
01:47:02.860 --> 01:47:05.280
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Kasi ang tagal na, ilang taon na na nire-reklamo yun.

asr-002270
01:47:05.300 --> 01:47:12.440
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Tapos, yung last meeting with the provincial government, hindi nga nila may bigay yung exact estimates eh.

asr-002271
