asr-002649
02:06:29.100 --> 02:06:30.180
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: intended for the

asr-002650
02:06:30.180 --> 02:06:30.600
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: construction

asr-002651
02:06:30.600 --> 02:06:42.120
