asr-002652
02:06:43.360 --> 02:06:48.320
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Pero ako na po rin po ang sasagot. Tatanungin ko na lang po ang dahilan.

asr-002653
02:06:51.440 --> 02:07:02.620
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Basis po sa aking data as July 15, 2026, these are the budget of the DepEd under its Basic Education Facilities Fund.

asr-002654
02:07:02.620 --> 02:07:07.780
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Which was in mark to the DPWH as a implementing agency.

asr-002655
02:07:07.780 --> 02:07:16.560
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: In Region 3, P595 million po ang classroom allocation.

asr-002656
02:07:16.560 --> 02:07:22.820
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: At ito'y dapat magagawa ng 261 na classroom.

asr-002657
02:07:23.060 --> 02:07:28.540
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: But in Region 3 alone, 76 po ang ating nagawa.

asr-002658
02:07:29.320 --> 02:07:31.320
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: In Region 4A,

asr-002659
02:07:31.580 --> 02:07:43.460
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ang dapat pong magawa na classroom ay 297, amounting of 523 million pesos, pero ang nagawa ay 48.

asr-002660
02:07:44.240 --> 02:07:56.860
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: In Region 5, 578 million, 280 classrooms completed, pero ang nagawa lamang ay 49.

asr-002661
02:07:57.720 --> 02:08:01.100
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Lalong-lalo na ang Region 5.

asr-002662
02:08:01.100 --> 02:08:03.460
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ay binabagyo palagi.

asr-002663
02:08:04.460 --> 02:08:16.580
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ngayon ang tanong ko, Mr. Chair, ano po ang dahilan kung bakit nadidelay ang pagpapagawa ng mga classroom sa Region 3, Region 4, and Region 5?

asr-002664
02:08:19.980 --> 02:08:29.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, yung pong 2025, tama po yung mga datos.

asr-002665
02:08:29.700 --> 02:08:33.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero meron na ito po tayong sinagawang catch-up plan.

asr-002666
02:08:33.360 --> 02:08:56.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At dumadami na po tayo ngayong 2026. At kampante po ang DPWH na yung lahat po ng 5,000 classrooms na nakabudget out of the 13 billion basic education fund for 2025 ay magagawa po by the end of 2026 or bago mag-expire yung pondo ng 2025.

asr-002667
02:08:57.980 --> 02:09:20.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Aminado po tayo na talaga pong nadelay. Ang rason po talaga dito and I think this needs to be addressed is yung pong number one, yung pong pagpipirma ng memorandum of agreement between DepEd at DPWH.

asr-002668
02:09:20.420 --> 02:09:26.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Na typically po noong 2020, noong mga previous years, napipirmahan na po yan.

asr-002669
02:09:27.000 --> 02:09:41.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mid-year na po. Minsan po umaabot. Kalimbawa yung 2025, napirmahan na po I was informed. August na of 2025, napirmahan ang MOA between DepEd and DPWH.

asr-002670
02:09:42.220 --> 02:09:56.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kung August po napirmahan ang MOA at alam po ni Chairman Romito, ang construction po ng classroom at the earliest, makakasimula po yan, October-November.

asr-002671
02:09:56.900 --> 02:10:09.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi po pagkatapos po ng MOA, i-validate pa po ang listahan ng mga classrooms sa iba't ibang lugar at mapapabid pa po yan after two months at makakapagsimula ang construction.

asr-002672
02:10:09.980 --> 02:10:23.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At yan po ang nangyayari, hindi lang noong 2025, kundi pati noong previous years. Ngayong pong 2026, minarapat po namin ng pabilisin ito.

asr-002673
02:10:24.150 --> 02:10:39.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ngayong 2026 po ay nakapagpirmahan po kami ng MOA nitong April 2026. A few months earlier than August. Medyo delayed pa rin po pero mas maaga po previous year.

asr-002674
02:10:39.780 --> 02:10:52.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And dahil po dyan, nagsimula na po tayo ng procurement process natin para sa classrooms ngayong pong Agosto.

asr-002675
02:10:53.380 --> 02:11:06.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kung dati po, MOA pa rin ng Agosto, previous years. Ngayon po, bidding na po tayo ng Agosto. So hopefully po, by September, start of construction na po tayo.

asr-002676
02:11:06.080 --> 02:11:11.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi tulad ng mga nakaraang taon, minsan November, December po nag-uumpisa ang construction.

asr-002677
02:11:11.800 --> 02:11:15.440
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

