Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ibig sabihin, luluwag-luwag na ang ating mga kabataan. Meron na silang sisilungan tuwing sila ay papasok.

asr-002678
02:11:25.320 --> 02:11:30.220
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: My next question, Mr. Chair, about the OPLAN Kontra Baha items.

asr-002679
02:11:31.320 --> 02:11:37.320
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: There are two lump sum items in the NEP for OPLAN Contra Baja nationwide.

asr-002680
02:11:38.040 --> 02:11:46.340
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: The first is the silting, dredging, cleaning of water waste with 369 million allocation

asr-002681
02:11:47.440 --> 02:11:53.100
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: The second is repair, rehabilitation, and maintenance of flood mitigation.

asr-002682
02:11:53.100 --> 02:11:56.840
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Structures in drainage system with 500 million.

asr-002683
