Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Sana at huwag tayong biguin, the Secretary Bench, as the representative of TGV Partylist and also as the president of the Partylist Coalition with 64 members,

asr-002717
02:14:38.540 --> 02:14:43.380
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: I firmly believe that you will do the right things for our country.

