Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: We have high hopes that you will resolve the flood problem na nagpapahirap sa bawat Pilipino.

asr-002719
02:14:51.200 --> 02:14:54.160
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Before the term of the President's end,

asr-002720
