Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: and if you need additional budget na sinasabi mo kanina para sa mga project engineers, I encourage my fellow colleagues to increase the budget of the DPWH at the proper time. Thank you very much.

asr-002721
02:15:09.540 --> 02:15:30.340
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Honorable Teves. Just to inform the other members siguro, Secretary, yung allotment na nakalagay or your allocation na nakalagay doon sa dredging, I think this is for the operation of your equipment. Para to be clear, operation of the equipment, gasolina, crude oil, then mga personnel para lang maintindihan ng lahat.

asr-002721-split1
02:15:30.400 --> 02:15:31.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yes po. Thank you. Thank you very much.

asr-002722
02:15:32.260 --> 02:15:39.500
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next question is from the minority, Honorable Percy Cendaña.

asr-002723
02:15:40.520 --> 02:15:45.080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Magandang umaga, Mr. Chair. Magandang umaga, Mr. Secretary, and to the DPWH family.

asr-002723-split1
02:15:45.560 --> 02:15:46.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Good morning po.

asr-002724
02:15:46.600 --> 02:16:07.080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Just a very brief rejoinder on the issue of commitment fees and the delays sa ating mga foreign-assisted projects. So, sinasabi po lagi ng gobyerno, meron tayong tight fiscal space. Pero taon-taon po, nagtatapon tayo ng bilyong-bilyong piso sa commitment fees sa mga proyekto hindi natin na-implement pero na-utang na natin at tumutubo pa.

asr-002726
02:16:07.260 --> 02:16:19.300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So this is a major concern especially in a time wherein we need so much to augment our social services. Tama na po itong pagtatapon ng perang ito sa commitment fees.

asr-002727
02:16:20.420 --> 02:16:32.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me now proceed to my first set of questions. Sa ating pong bagong Government Procurement Act, meron po tayong updated guidelines sa pag-blacklist ng mga contractors at mga suppliers.

asr-002728
02:16:33.780 --> 02:16:41.400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pwede po ba akong mahingi ng update sa Secretary natin kung mayroon po ba tayong bilang ng mga na-blacklist na contractors at suppliers?

asr-002729
02:16:41.920 --> 02:16:46.560
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At kung ano po yung madalas na dahilan ng pag-blacklist sa mga contractors na ito, Mr. Chair?

asr-002730
02:16:47.400 --> 02:16:59.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chair, I will give the final number of blacklisted. Pero ang dahilan po nito ay unang-una, yung mga under investigation at may kaso na. Yan po, blacklisted na po yan. Ikalawa po,

asr-002731
02:17:00.000 --> 02:17:10.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yung mga iba pong mga kontratista na hindi na binigyan at inisyu-han ng mga PCAB licenses, for whatever reasons, dahil sa involvement nila dito sa scandal, blacklisted na rin po iyon.

asr-002732
02:17:10.780 --> 02:17:16.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But we will give the complete list to the Honorable Percy Cendaña.

asr-002733
02:17:17.820 --> 02:17:19.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Immediately po, ipapa-ano ko lang po

asr-002734
02:17:20.460 --> 02:17:21.620
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Through the committee, sir.

asr-002735
02:17:22.660 --> 02:17:24.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Of course, through the committee po.

asr-002736
02:17:24.800 --> 02:17:28.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Thank you, Mr. Secretary. Wala po bang ballpark figure man lang?

asr-002737
02:17:28.920 --> 02:17:30.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yes. More than 10, right?

asr-002738
02:17:30.720 --> 02:17:39.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: This is very important because it was the President who began the exposé on this matter. So by now, we expect that the DPWH has acted on this.

asr-002739
02:17:44.380 --> 02:17:47.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mga ano po, between 10 to 15 po ay na-blacklist na.

asr-002740
02:17:48.480 --> 02:17:56.080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Parang yan din po yung bilang nung nandun sa isumbong sa Pangulo na site eh. So I was actually expecting more. Pero sige po, lihis lang po ako ng konti.

asr-002741
02:17:56.080 --> 02:18:01.360
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasama po ba dun sa ating mga dahilan ng pag-blacklist yung labor violations?

asr-002742
02:18:02.040 --> 02:18:12.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Specifically, poor working conditions, failure to comply with occupational health and safety standards, and refusal to follow wage orders in the region where they operate.

asr-002743
02:18:16.860 --> 02:18:24.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa mga na-blacklist na po, hindi po yun yung, hindi po naging basis yung labor violations dito sa mga na-blacklist na ito.

asr-002744
02:18:24.820 --> 02:18:35.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And would the good Secretary consider endorsing ito pong violation ng labor standards at labor rights as a guideline for blacklisting of contractors?

asr-002745
02:18:36.400 --> 02:18:38.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Absolutely po, Mr. Chairman.

asr-002746
02:18:38.360 --> 02:18:46.300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair, Mr. Secretary, sapagkat ito pong nagpigil para ma-implement ang wage hike dito po sa NCR.

asr-002747
02:18:46.540 --> 02:18:55.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maliit na nga po iyong 85 pesos, pinigilan pa, ay dalawa pong contractor. Yung isa po doon, I understand, milyon-milyon ang kontrata, lahat sa DPWH.

asr-002748
02:18:55.940 --> 02:19:04.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Chair, may we direct DPWH, through the committee, to kindly submit to this committee the list of projects in the last three years awarded to Redicon.

asr-002749
02:19:04.960 --> 02:19:10.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito po yung isa sa dalawa na nagpigil through a TRO sa wage hike po sa NCR.

asr-002750
02:19:10.760 --> 02:19:12.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We will comply, Mr. Chairman.

asr-002751
02:19:14.940 --> 02:19:21.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Chair, gusto ko lang din pong balikan yung issue ng safety and accessibility.

asr-002752
02:19:22.300 --> 02:19:31.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa ngayon po kasi, isa itong usapin na talagang matindi yung naging gap in the last few years, particularly po sa ating public infrastructure.

asr-002753
02:19:32.360 --> 02:19:39.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kanina lamang po, may ka-meeting ako ng mga PWD leaders sa aking opisina, and lo and behold, when they asked kung may PWD parking ang Kongreso,

asr-002754
02:19:39.920 --> 02:19:44.040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ang sabi, walang PWD parking, House of Representatives. Nakalulungkot po.

asr-002756
02:19:44.320 --> 02:19:47.420
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa isang PWD event po, may na-meet po ako ng isang rapper.

asr-002757
02:19:47.820 --> 02:19:50.040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang pangalang po ng rapper, The Righteous One.

asr-002758
02:19:50.240 --> 02:19:54.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ang sabi po ni The Righteous One, para sa kanila ng mga PWD,

asr-002759
02:19:54.160 --> 02:19:59.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ang good governance simply means kapag umaandar ang elevator sa MRT.

asr-002760
02:19:59.600 --> 02:20:04.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Alam ko po, hindi kasama ang MRT sa coverage ng area of work ng DPWH.

asr-002761
02:20:04.920 --> 02:20:14.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero, inuulit ko po, good governance for our PWD siblings is as simple as accessibility infrastructure, for our PWD brothers and sisters.

asr-002763
02:20:14.760 --> 02:20:24.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ano po ang assessment ang DPWH sa compliance sa BP344 or the Accessibility Law, especially across its road and infrastructure projects?

asr-002765
02:20:24.940 --> 02:20:31.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Halimbawa po, may datos po ba tayo kung ilang DPWH projects ang compliant sa accessibility standards ng gobyerno?

asr-002766
02:20:34.200 --> 02:20:37.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: With the permission of the... I will answer this very directly.

asr-002767
02:20:37.200 --> 02:20:38.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: It's... It's...

asr-002768
02:20:42.380 --> 02:20:43.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: What word can I use?

asr-002769
02:20:44.100 --> 02:20:48.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Terrible compliance to the accessibility law.

asr-002770
02:20:48.520 --> 02:20:51.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I mean, kitang-kita naman po natin yung mga kalsada natin, walang sidewalk eh.

asr-002771
02:20:52.900 --> 02:20:57.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: No, kaya nga po, slowly but surely, pinapakita po natin na pwede natin gawin ng tama.

asr-002772
02:20:57.700 --> 02:21:00.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Halimbawa po, EDSA.

asr-002773
02:21:02.160 --> 02:21:06.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ako po mismo, sinamahan ko po yung mga mobility advocates natin, yung mga PWDs natin.

asr-002774
02:21:07.000 --> 02:21:10.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi po pwedeng maglakad at mag-commute ang mga PWDs natin sa EDSA.

asr-002775
02:21:11.740 --> 02:21:14.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi mamamatay po siya, masasagasaan po siya dyan.

asr-002776
02:21:14.220 --> 02:21:18.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But now, with the rehab, we are making sure that we are widening them.

asr-002777
02:21:18.760 --> 02:21:28.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Not only widening the sidewalk, but we are providing for the standards that are in the accessibility law.

asr-002778
02:21:28.060 --> 02:21:33.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But unfortunately, hindi po ito nai-implement sa buong Pilipinas.

asr-002779
02:21:33.220 --> 02:21:35.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And malayo pa po ang kailangan natin marating dito.

asr-002780
02:21:36.340 --> 02:21:40.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero yun po, kaya nga po, from about 100 million in...

asr-002781
02:21:40.760 --> 02:21:42.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 170 million

asr-002782
02:21:42.540 --> 02:21:49.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: last year, for PWD infrastructure, tinaas po natin ito to 500 million this year.

asr-002783
02:21:49.200 --> 02:21:51.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero kulang pa rin po yan, Mr. Chairman.

asr-002784
02:21:51.460 --> 02:21:55.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But ngayon po, ang instructions po natin sa ating mga DEOs at RDs,

asr-002785
02:21:55.580 --> 02:22:02.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kailangan po yung mga kagaya natin, kailangan may rampa, kailangan may sidewalk na wide enough.

asr-002786
02:22:02.480 --> 02:22:11.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero malayo pa po ang ating kailangan marating bago tayo umabot sa full compliance with the accessibility law.

asr-002787
02:22:11.660 --> 02:23:02.940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair, Mr. Secretary. For the very transparent and candid response. Tatanungin ko po sana kung ilang footbridge natin sa Metro Manila ang may functioning elevator. Pero batay po sa sagot nyo, alam ko na agad ang magiging tugon. Nakakarimarim po at nakakabiyak ng puso ito pong failure ng ating public infrastructure para po bigyan ng access ang mga kapatid nating PWD. Inuulit ko po, sabi ni Righteous One, para sa kanya, simple lang ang good governance. May umaandar na elevator sa footbridge, may umaandar na elevator sa MRT. At meron pa po pong nakausap kanina, sabi niya, simple lang ang good governance sa kanila, yung kakasya ang wheelchair sa sidewalk. Apparently, when you go through Metro Manila, maraming sidewalk, hindi kakasya ang wheelchair. So yan po yung nakakarimarim na kalagayan ng public infrastructure and issue of accessibility in this country.

asr-002797
02:23:04.340 --> 02:23:09.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, we could not agree more with the Honorable Cendaña.

asr-002798
02:23:10.140 --> 02:23:15.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Para po sa huling set of questions, Mr. Chair, gusto ko na pong itali from accessibility to issue of health.

asr-002800
02:23:16.120 --> 02:23:25.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ngayon po, parang regular feature na ng mga balita, may isang segment ng road accidents. At pataas po ng pataas ang bilang ng road accidents sa Pilipinas.

asr-002802
02:23:25.460 --> 02:23:31.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: For example, 13,125 Filipinos died from road crashes in 2023.

asr-002803
02:23:32.920 --> 02:23:43.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At sinasabi po ng DOH that the top cause of death among Filipinos aged 15 to 29 years old ay itong mga road crashes and road accidents.

asr-002804
02:23:43.320 --> 02:23:53.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ano po ang ginagawa pagdating sa infrastructure ng DPWH para tiyakin ang safety ng ating mga kababayan? Lalo na po karamihan dito ay mga commuters.

asr-002806
02:23:53.540 --> 02:23:56.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Again, Mr. Chairman, napaka-importante po ng tanong.

asr-002807
02:23:56.500 --> 02:24:00.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Alam niyo po, if I may be given some time po to answer this because it's very important.

asr-002808
02:24:00.640 --> 02:24:15.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Alam niyo po, pag umiikot po ako sa buong bansa, ang isa po sa pinakabinabantayan po ay yung safety standards ng mga ongoing construction.

asr-002810
02:24:15.820 --> 02:24:26.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Alam niyo po, nung ako po'y bumisita sa Cordillera, meron po diyang nasira na kalye, iyong  Beckel Road, papuntang Ambuclao mula sa Baguio.

asr-002811
02:24:27.260 --> 02:24:30.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron pong nahulog dyan na 13-year-old cyclist, namatay po.

asr-002812
02:24:32.020 --> 02:24:42.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa galit ko po, immediately po, tinanggal ko po yung DE doon dahil hindi po nag-comply ang construction doon sa safety standards na prescribed.

asr-002814
02:24:43.240 --> 02:24:48.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil po diyan, and I will ask Undersecretary Lara to give you some details, Mr. Chairman.

asr-002815
02:24:50.080 --> 02:24:58.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pinatagagang pinayos po natin ang safety standards natin at pinapa-implement po natin very strictly with the threat of removal.

asr-002816
02:24:58.860 --> 02:25:11.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kapag po ang mga DEs natin at RDs ay hindi nag-comply at ang ginagawa lang ay caution tape sa mga ongoing projects, tanggal po sila.

asr-002817
02:25:12.399 --> 02:25:20.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Talaga pong ano eh. Nakakarimarim yung word po na ginamit ni Congressman kanina. Kasi po buhay po ang nakasalalay dito sa safety.

asr-002820
02:25:20.500 --> 02:25:30.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: If I can just pass on lang po to Usec Lara, Mr. Chairman, para lang po makapagbigay ng konting brief doon sa pagtataas ng standards ng safety sa construction sites.

asr-002821
02:25:31.040 --> 02:25:32.580
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Usec Lara, you're recognized.

asr-002822
02:25:32.980 --> 02:25:36.300
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: Good morning po, Mr. Chair. Good morning po, the Honorable Congressman.

asr-002823
02:25:37.320 --> 02:26:12.320
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: Sa safety standards po, meron na po tayong existing manual but we also want to update this. Yung problem lang po ay hindi na-highlight enough sa mga people on the ground. That's why this semester, we've been conducting trainings po sa ating mga project engineers just to explain to them in detail na iba-ibang klaseng road slips, road collapse, or even just small fixing of potholes. Lahat po ay kailangan ng road safety standards na dependent po sa speed ng road natin, ganun po kalayo ang warning sign natin.

asr-002827
02:26:12.360 --> 02:26:17.560
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: Hindi kasi po puwede na ngayon lang lalagyan mo na ng harang. It would cause accidents po.

asr-002829
02:26:17.620 --> 02:26:27.460
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: So we are training our project engineers na hindi lang po tayo sa project implementation but also on providing appropriate road safety measures para po sa ating riding public po.

asr-002830
02:26:27.940 --> 02:26:28.720
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: Maraming salamat.

asr-002831
02:26:28.860 --> 02:26:33.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, we will provide the updated handbook to the committee para po makita.

asr-002832
02:26:34.040 --> 02:26:41.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But I think ang importante nga po dito na i-emphasize is kahit na gano'n po kaganda yung handbook natin, kung ito po ay hindi gagawin.

asr-002833
02:26:42.680 --> 02:26:47.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ng ating mga regions at districts, [unclear] wala po iyong handbook na iyan.

asr-002834
02:26:47.240 --> 02:26:55.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya ang importante nga po, maintindihan ng lahat na may consequences po kapag meron pong na-aksidente at meron pong namatay.

asr-002835
02:26:55.580 --> 02:26:57.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Recently po, sa Naga po, may na-aksidente.

asr-002836
02:26:57.860 --> 02:26:59.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Na-ICU po iyong dalawang mag-asawa.

asr-002837
02:27:00.240 --> 02:27:01.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Awa ng Diyos, wala pong namatay.

asr-002838
02:27:02.920 --> 02:27:05.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero yung pong district engineer yun, natanggal din po yun.

asr-002839
02:27:05.480 --> 02:27:11.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So there needs to be consequences po, hindi nga po yung pagbabago ng handbook o pagbabago ng standards.

asr-002840
02:27:11.960 --> 02:27:12.700
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Secretary.

asr-002841
02:27:12.980 --> 02:27:14.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Honorable Perci.

asr-002842
02:27:14.640 --> 02:27:20.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Chair, I have, I think, 10 seconds more kasi po tumuloy yung timer habang sumasagot si Secretary.

asr-002844
02:27:20.800 --> 02:27:21.140
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: 10 seconds.

asr-002846
02:27:21.740 --> 02:27:28.960
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mabilis naman po. 94% po ng mga Pilipino ay commuters at 94% po sa mga commuters na ito,

asr-002847
02:27:28.960 --> 02:27:31.300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng mga kababayan natin, at risk po everyday.

asr-002848
02:27:31.880 --> 02:27:39.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Dahil po sa ganitong mga gaps in terms of our public infrastructure, particularly our roads, tigilan na po natin gawing mamamatay-tao

asr-002849
02:27:39.720 --> 02:27:42.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ang ating mga kalsada. Let us make it safe.

asr-002851
02:27:42.180 --> 02:27:43.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Salamat po, Mr. Chair.

asr-002852
02:27:43.260 --> 02:27:44.880
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, thank you, Honorable Percy.

asr-002853
02:27:45.220 --> 02:27:48.660
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: In addition to the question of Honorable Perci Cendaña,

asr-002854
02:27:49.240 --> 02:27:54.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Secretary, I don't know if there is a department order still in force

asr-002855
02:27:54.160 --> 02:27:59.940
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: that 5% of your allocation can be used for PWD structures?

asr-002856
02:28:02.180 --> 02:28:03.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Usec Lara, please.

asr-002857
02:28:04.040 --> 02:28:09.020
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: Mr. Chair, we've already allotted separate funding for them.

asr-002858
02:28:09.880 --> 02:28:12.540
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: Naglaan na po tayo ng funding sa NEP po.

asr-002859
02:28:12.560 --> 02:28:16.100
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So hindi na doon sa mismong project appropriation?

asr-002860
02:28:16.340 --> 02:28:19.300
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: Naglagay na po kami ng separate line item po mismo.

asr-002862
02:28:19.500 --> 02:28:21.520
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: sa NEP at sa GAA po

asr-002864
02:28:21.640 --> 02:28:23.000
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Okay, thank you.

asr-002865
02:28:23.000 --> 02:28:26.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, mukha po kasing dati, parang hindi nasusunod yung 5% na iyon.

asr-002866
02:28:26.380 --> 02:28:32.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So mas maganda pong maglaan na tayo ng considerable amount specifically for that.

asr-002867
02:28:32.860 --> 02:28:33.780
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So line item na talaga.

asr-002867-split1
02:28:33.940 --> 02:28:34.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo.

asr-002868
02:28:34.160 --> 02:28:35.080
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, thank you.

asr-002869
02:28:35.160 --> 02:28:44.880
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next and the last member of the Appropriations Committee to ask for this morning's meeting is Honorable Mike Tan.

asr-002871
02:28:44.980 --> 02:28:49.720
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: After Mike Tan, Honorable Mike Tan's question, mag-break muna tayo,

asr-002872
02:28:49.720 --> 02:28:50.780
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Secretary dahil meron kang

asr-002873
02:28:52.000 --> 02:28:53.260
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: lunch meeting yata kay

asr-002874
02:28:53.260 --> 02:28:55.200
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Speaker, we will be back

asr-002875
02:28:55.200 --> 02:28:57.360
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: exactly 1 o'clock. Dahil

